INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('edwnh/dqmc/dqmc-advanced', 'dqmc-advanced', 'edwnh', 'dqmc', 'community', 'dqmc-advanced edwnh dqmc community The dqmc-advanced skill enables advanced topics such as unequal-time measurements and analytic continuation for AI agents. It benefits developers working with time-dependent correlation functions and zero-frequency susceptibilities. dqmc-advanced是一种高级AI工具，支持不等时间测量和分析性连续性，适用于开发高性能AI应用 dqmc-advancedは、高度なAIツールであり、不等時間測定と解析的連続性をサポートし、高性能AIアプリケーションの開発に適しています dqmc-advanced는 고급 AI 도구로, 불균일 시간 측정 및 해석적 연속성을 지원하여 고성능 AI 애플리케이션 개발에 적합합니다 dqmc-advanced es una herramienta para realizar mediciones avanzadas, incluyendo mediciones de tiempo desigual y continuación analítica de datos de tiempo imaginario a frecuencias reales dqmc-advanced est un outil pour effectuer des mesures avancées, notamment des mesures de temps inégales et la poursuite analytique des données de temps imaginaire à des fréquences réelles dqmc-advanced ist ein Tool für erweiterte Messungen, einschließlich ungleichzeitiger Messungen und analytischer Fortsetzung von imaginären Zeitdaten auf reale Frequenzen O dqmc-advanced é uma ferramenta de AI Agents que permite medições de tempo desigual e continuação analítica para tópicos avançados dqmc-advanced - это инструмент ИИ Агентов, который позволяет проводить неравномерные измерения времени и аналитическое продолжение для продвинутых тем dqmc-advanced هو أداة آلات الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تمكن القياسات الزمنية غير المتساوية والاستمرار التحليلي لمواضيع متقدمة how to use dqmc-advanced dqmc-advanced setup guide dqmc-advanced alternative dqmc-advanced vs other AI skills dqmc-advanced install what is dqmc-advanced dqmc-advanced tutorial dqmc-advanced advanced topics dqmc-advanced unequal-time measurements dqmc-advanced AI工具 不等时间测量 分析性连续性 零频率磁化率 D波对磁化率 时间相关函数 Enables unequal-time measurements by setting `period_uneqlt > 0` during file generation Supports analytic continuation using maximum entropy for imaginary-time data Required for zero-frequency susceptibilities (`nnrw0`, `zzrw0`) and D-wave pair susceptibility (`dwq0t`) Allows for time-dependent correlation functions Increases runtime and memory usage due to unequal-time measurements dqmc-advanced is a skill that provides advanced functionality for AI agents, including unequal-time measurements and analytic continuation.');
