ent Events, gRPC 지원","직관적인 데스크톱 API 클라이언트","API 요청을 조직하고 실행","Postman과 Insomnia의 대체","Tauri 지원"],"es":["Soporte para REST, GraphQL, WebSockets, Server Sent Events y gRPC","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva","Organización y ejecución de solicitudes API","Alternativa a Postman y Insomnia","Compatibilidad con Tauri"],"fr":["Prise en charge de REST, GraphQL, WebSockets, Server Sent Events et gRPC","Interface utilisateur intuitive","Organisation et exécution de requêtes API","Alternative à Postman et Insomnia","Compatibilité avec Tauri"],"de":["Unterstützung für REST, GraphQL, WebSockets, Server Sent Events und gRPC","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche","Organisation und Ausführung von API-Anfragen","Alternative zu Postman und Insomnia","Kompatibilität mit Tauri"],"pt":["Suporte a REST, GraphQL, WebSockets e gRPC","Interface de usuário intuitiva","Organização e execução de requisições de API","Alternativa a Postman e Insomnia","Desenvolvido com Tauri"],"ru":["Поддержка REST, GraphQL, WebSockets и gRPC","Интуитивный интерфейс пользователя","Организация и выполнение запросов API","Альтернатива Postman и Insomnia","Разработано с помощью Tauri"],"ar":["دعم REST و GraphQL و WebSockets و gRPC","واجهة مستخدم直جية","تنظيم وتشغيل طلبات API","بديل ل Postman و Insomnia","تم تطويره باستخدام Tauri"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","桌面API客户端","REST API","GraphQL","WebSockets","Server Sent Events","gRPC","Postman替代","Insomnia替代","Tauri"],"ja":["AIエージェント","デスクトップAPIクライアント","REST API","GraphQL","WebSockets","Server Sent Events","gRPC","Postmanの代替","Insomniaの代替","Tauri"],"ko":["AI 도구","데스크톱 API 클라이언트","REST API","GraphQL","WebSockets","Server Sent Events","gRPC","Postman 대체","Insomnia 대체","Tauri"],"es":["cómo usar release-check-out-pr","qué es release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr vs Postman","alternativa a Insomnia","instalación de release-check-out-pr","guía de configuración de release-check-out-pr","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","clientes API de escritorio"],"fr":["comment utiliser release-check-out-pr","qu''est-ce que release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr vs Postman","alternative à Insomnia","installation de release-check-out-pr","guide de configuration de release-check-out-pr","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","clients API de bureau"],"de":["wie man release-check-out-pr verwendet","was ist release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr vs Postman","Alternative zu Insomnia","Installation von release-check-out-pr","Konfigurationsanleitung für release-check-out-pr","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Desktop-API-Clients"],"pt":["como usar release-check-out-pr","o que é release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr vs postman","release-check-out-pr alternative","instalar release-check-out-pr","guia de configuração do release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr e graphql","release-check-out-pr e websockets"],"ru":["как использовать release-check-out-pr","что такое release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr vs postman","release-check-out-pr альтернатива","установить release-check-out-pr","руководство по настройке release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr и graphql","release-check-out-pr и websockets"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام release-check-out-pr","ما هو release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr مقابل postman","release-check-out-pr بديل","تثبيت release-check-out-pr","دليل إعداد release-check-out-pr","release-check-out-pr و graphql","release-check-out-pr و websockets"]}},"owner":"mountain-loop","repo":"yaak","repoPath":"mountain-loop/yaak","stars":17937,"forks":714,"updatedAt":"2026-02-26T00:46:47Z","topics":["bruno-alternative","graphql","grpc","http","http-client","insomnia-alternative","postman-alternative","sse","tauri","websocket"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-check-out-pr","description":"Check out a GitHub pull request for review in this repo, either in the current directory or in a new isolated worktree at ../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>. Use when asked to run or replace the old Claude check-out-pr command.","bodyPreview":"# Check Out PR\n\nCheck out a PR by number and let the user choose between current-directory checkout and isolated worktree checkout.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm `gh` CLI is available.\n2. If no PR number is provided, list open PRs (`gh pr list`) and ask the user to choose one.\n3. Read PR metadata:\n   - `gh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --json number,headRefName`\n4. Ask the user to choose:\n   - Option A: check out in the current directory\n   - Option B: create a new worktree at `../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>","body":"# Check Out PR\n\nCheck out a PR by number and let the user choose between current-directory checkout and isolated worktree checkout.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Confirm `gh` CLI is available.\n2. If no PR number is provided, list open PRs (`gh pr list`) and ask the user to choose one.\n3. Read PR metadata:\n   - `gh pr view <PR_NUMBER> --json number,headRefName`\n4. Ask the user to choose:\n   - Option A: check out in the current directory\n   - Option B: create a new worktree at `../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>`\n\n## Option A: Current Directory\n\n1. Run:\n   - `gh pr checkout <PR_NUMBER>`\n2. Report the checked-out branch.\n\n## Option B: New Worktree\n\n1. Use path:\n   - `../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>`\n2. Create the worktree with a timeout of at least 5 minutes because checkout hooks run bootstrap.\n3. In the new worktree, run:\n   - `gh pr checkout <PR_NUMBER>`\n4. Report:\n   - Worktree path\n   - Assigned ports from `.env.local` if present\n   - How to start work:\n     - `cd ../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>`\n     - `npm run app-dev`\n   - How to remove when done:\n     - `git worktree remove ../yaak-worktrees/pr-<PR_NUMBER>`\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If PR does not exist, show a clear error.\n- If worktree already exists, ask whether to reuse it or remove/recreate it.\n- If `gh` is missing, instruct the user to install/authenticate it.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:26:15.807Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for GitHub Integration Agents needing streamlined PR checkout and management capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要简化 PR 检出和管理功能的 GitHub 集成代理。","ja":"GitHub の統合エージェントがストリームライン化された PR チェックアウトと管理機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"스트림라이닝된 PR 체크아웃 및 관리 기능이 필요한 GitHub 통합 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Integración de GitHub que necesitan capacidades de verificación y administración de PR optimizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Intégration GitHub nécessitant des capacités de vérification et de gestion de PR rationalisées.","de":"Perfekt für GitHub-Integration-Agents, die optimierte PR-Checkout- und Managementfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents de Integração do GitHub que precisam de capacidades de checkout e gerenciamento de PRs otimizadas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интеграции GitHub, которым необходимы оптимизированные возможности проверки и управления PR.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تضمين GitHub الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات إدارة و فحص PR محسّنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to seamlessly check out PRs by number, utilizing the `gh` CLI for efficient workflow management, including listing open PRs and reading PR metadata via `gh pr view` and `--json` protocols.","zh":"赋予代理无缝检查 PR 的能力，通过 `gh` CLI 实现高效的工作流管理，包括列出打开的 PR 和通过 `gh pr view` 和 `--json` 协议读取 PR 元数据。","ja":"エージェントが PR を番号でチェックアウトできるようにし、`gh` CLI を使用して効率的なワークフロー管理を実現します。開いている PR を一覧表示したり、`gh pr view` および `--json` プロトコルを介して PR メタデータを読み取ったりすることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 PR 번호로 체크아웃 할 수 있도록 하여 `gh` CLI를 사용하여 효율적인 워크플로우 관리를 구현합니다. 열린 PR을 나열하거나 `gh pr view` 및 `--json` 프로토콜을 통해 PR 메타데이터를 읽는 것과 같은 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a verificar PR de forma fluida por número, utilizando el CLI `gh` para una gestión de flujo de trabajo eficiente, incluyendo la lista de PR abiertos y la lectura de metadatos de PR a través de `gh pr view` y protocolos `--json`.","fr":"Permet aux agents de vérifier les PR de manière fluide par numéro, en utilisant le CLI `gh` pour une gestion de workflow efficiente, y compris la liste des PR ouverts et la lecture des métadonnées de PR via `gh pr view` et les protocoles `--json`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, PRs nahtlos durch Nummer zu überprüfen, indem sie das `gh` CLI für eine effiziente Workflow-Verwaltung verwenden, einschließlich der Auflistung offener PRs und dem Lesen von PR-Metadaten über `gh pr view` und `--json`-Protokolle.","pt":"Permite que os agentes façam checkout de PRs de forma transparente por número, utilizando o `gh` CLI para gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho eficiente, incluindo a listagem de PRs abertos e a leitura de metadados de PR por meio dos protocolos `gh pr view` e `--json`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам прозрачно проверять PR по номеру, используя `gh` CLI для эффективного управления рабочим процессом, включая список открытых PR и чтение метаданных PR через протоколы `gh pr view` и `--json`.","ar":"يسمح للوكلاء بفحص PRs بشكل منسق حسب الرقم، من خلال استخدام `gh` CLI لإدارة سير العمل بكفاءة، بما في ذلك قائمة PRs المفتوحة وقراءة بيانات التعريف PR عبر بروتوكولات `gh pr view` و `--json`."},"useCases":{"en":["Checking out specific PRs for review","Automating PR testing and validation","Streamlining PR management workflows with isolated worktree checkouts"],"zh":["用于审查的特定 PR 检出","自动化 PR 测试和验证","使用隔离工作树检查出简化 PR 管理工作流"],"ja":["レビューのための特定の PR のチェックアウト","PR の自動テストと検証","隔離されたワークツリーのチェックアウトを使用した PR 管理ワークフローの効率化"],"ko":["검토를 위한 특정 PR 체크아웃","PR 테스트 및 유효성 검사의 자동화","격리된 워크트리의 체크아웃을 사용한 PR 관리 워크플로우의 스트림라이닝"],"es":["Verificación de PR específicas para revisión","Automatización de pruebas y validación de PR","Optimización de flujos de trabajo de administración de PR con comprobaciones de worktree aisladas"],"fr":["Vérification de PR spécifiques pour examen","Automatisation des tests et de la validation des PR","Optimisation des flux de travail de gestion des PR avec des vérifications de worktree isolées"],"de":["Überprüfung spezifischer PRs zur Überprüfung","Automatisierung von PR-Tests und -Validierung","Optimierung von PR-Management-Workflows mit isolierten Worktree-Checks"],"pt":["Verificação de PRs específicos para revisão","Automatização de testes e validação de PRs","Otimização de fluxos de trabalho de gerenciamento de PRs com checkouts de worktree isolados"],"ru":["Проверка конкретных PR для рассмотрения","Автоматизация тестирования и проверки PR","Оптимизация рабочих процессов управления PR с помощью изолированных проверок worktree"],"ar":["فحص PRs محددة للمراجعة","أتمتة اختبار و تحقق PRs","تحسين تدفقات عمل إدارة PRs باستخدام عمليات فحص شجرة العمل المعزولة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires `gh` CLI availability","Limited to GitHub PR workflow"],"zh":["需要 `gh` CLI 的可用性","仅限 GitHub PR 工作流"],"ja":["`gh` CLI の可用性が必要","GitHub の PR ワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["`gh` CLI의 가용성이 필요함","GitHub PR 워크플로에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la disponibilidad del CLI `gh`","Limitado al flujo de trabajo de PR de GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite la disponibilité du CLI `gh`","Limité au flux de travail de PR de GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt die Verfügbarkeit des `gh` CLI","Begrenzt auf den GitHub-PR-Workflow"],"pt":["Requer disponibilidade do `gh` CLI","Limitado ao fluxo de trabalho de PR do GitHub"],"ru":["Требует доступности `gh` CLI","Ограничен только рабочим процессом PR GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب توافر `gh` CLI","محدود بتدفق عمل PRs في GitHub فقط"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9c94cd0cdf584f34f86435059b36e6948d7da3e1ae7d7e2491bc974dac16089a","qualityScore":30}');
