igo aberto","Implementação fácil de eventos","Desenvolvido para desenvolvedores","Código aberto e personalizável","Suporte a múltiplos eventos"],"ru":["Открытый менеджер тегов","Легкая реализация событий","Разработан для разработчиков","Открытый и настраиваемый код","Поддержка множества событий"],"ar":["مدير علامات مفتوح المصدر","تطبيق_events بسهولة","تم تطويره للمطورين","مفتوح المصدر وقابل للتخصيص","دعم متعدد_Events"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Walkeros","什么是事件理解","Walkeros 替代品","Walkeros 与其他工具的比较","Walkeros 安装","Walkeros 设置指南","开源标签管理器","事件处理工具"],"ja":["Walkeros の使い方","イベント理解とは","Walkeros の代替","Walkeros と他のツールの比較","Walkeros のインストール","Walkeros の設定ガイド","オープンソースタグマネージャー","イベント処理ツール"],"ko":["Walkeros 사용법","이벤트 이해란","Walkeros 대체품","Walkeros와 다른 툴의 비교","Walkeros 설치","Walkeros 설정 가이드","오픈소스 태그 매니저","이벤트 처리 툴"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","gestor de etiquetas de código abierto","cómo usar walkeros-understanding-events","alternativas a walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events vs Google Tag Manager","instalación de walkeros-understanding-events","guía de configuración de walkeros-understanding-events"],"fr":["outils IA pour les développeurs","gestionnaire de balises open-source","comment utiliser walkeros-understanding-events","alternatives à walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events vs Google Tag Manager","installation de walkeros-understanding-events","guide de configuration de walkeros-understanding-events"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Open-Source-Tag-Manager","wie man walkeros-understanding-events verwendet","Alternativen zu walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events vs Google Tag Manager","Installation von walkeros-understanding-events","Konfigurationsanleitung für walkeros-understanding-events"],"pt":["como usar walkeros-understanding-events","o que é walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events alternativa","walkeros-understanding-events vs google tag manager","instalar walkeros-understanding-events","guia de configuração do walkeros-understanding-events","desenvolvimento de eventos com walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать walkeros-understanding-events","что такое walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events альтернатива","walkeros-understanding-events vs google tag manager","установить walkeros-understanding-events","руководство по настройке walkeros-understanding-events","разработка событий с walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام walkeros-understanding-events","ما هو walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events بديل","walkeros-understanding-events مقابل google tag manager","تثبيت walkeros-understanding-events","دليل إعداد walkeros-understanding-events","تطوير_Events مع walkeros-understanding-events","walkeros-understanding-events للمطورين"]}},"owner":"elbwalker","repo":"walkerOS","repoPath":"elbwalker/walkerOS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"walkeros-understanding-events","description":"","bodyPreview":"# Understanding walkerOS Events\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS events are self-describing, stateless, vendor-agnostic data structures.\nThey capture user interactions in a standardized format that can be transformed\nfor any destination.\n\n**Core principle:** Events describe WHAT happened, not WHERE it goes. Stateless.\nSelf-describing. Industry-agnostic.\n\n## Entity-Action Naming (Critical)\n\n**STRICT REQUIREMENT:** All events use \"entity action\" format with space\nseparation.\n\n```typescript\n// Correct\n''page","body":"# Understanding walkerOS Events\n\n## Overview\n\nwalkerOS events are self-describing, stateless, vendor-agnostic data structures.\nThey capture user interactions in a standardized format that can be transformed\nfor any destination.\n\n**Core principle:** Events describe WHAT happened, not WHERE it goes. Stateless.\nSelf-describing. Industry-agnostic.\n\n## Entity-Action Naming (Critical)\n\n**STRICT REQUIREMENT:** All events use \"entity action\" format with space\nseparation.\n\n```typescript\n// Correct\n''page view'';\n''product add'';\n''order complete'';\n''button click'';\n\n// Wrong\n''page_view''; // underscore\n''pageview''; // no separator\n''purchase''; // no entity\n''add_to_cart''; // wrong format\n```\n\n**Parsing:** `const [entity, action] = event.split('' '')`\n\n- **Entity:** Noun (page, product, user, order, button)\n- **Action:** Verb (view, add, complete, click, login)\n\n## Event Properties\n\nSee\n[packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts)\nfor canonical types (Event interface, plus event helpers in `event.ts`).\n\n| Property    | Type   | Purpose                    | Example                               |\n| ----------- | ------ | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `name`      | string | \"entity action\" format     | `\"product view\"`                      |\n| `data`      | object | Entity-specific properties | `{ id: \"P123\", price: 99 }`           |\n| `context`   | object | State/environment info     | `{ stage: [\"checkout\", 1] }`          |\n| `globals`   | object | Global properties          | `{ language: \"en\" }`                  |\n| `user`      | object | User identification        | `{ id: \"user123\" }`                   |\n| `nested`    | array  | Related entities           | `[{ type: \"category\", data: {...} }]` |\n| `consent`   | object | Consent states             | `{ marketing: true }`                 |\n| `id`        | string | Auto-generated unique ID   | `\"1647261462000-01b5e2-2\"`            |\n| `timestamp` | number | Auto-generated Unix ms     | `1647261462000`                       |\n| `entity`    | string | Parsed from name           | `\"product\"`                           |\n| `action`    | string | Parsed from name           | `\"view\"`                              |\n\n### data Property\n\nEntity-specific properties. Schema-free but consistent within entity type.\n\n```typescript\n// product entity\ndata: { id: \"P123\", name: \"Laptop\", price: 999, currency: \"USD\" }\n\n// page entity\ndata: { title: \"Home\", path: \"/\", referrer: \"https://...\" }\n```\n\n### context Property\n\nHierarchical state information. Format: `{ name: [value, order] }`\n\n```typescript\ncontext: {\n  stage: [\"checkout\", 1],    // checkout stage, first step\n  test: [\"variant-A\", 0],    // A/B test variant\n  group: [\"premium\", 2]      // user segment\n}\n```\n\n### globals Property\n\nProperties that apply to ALL events in the session.\n\n```typescript\nglobals: {\n  language: \"en\",\n  currency: \"USD\",\n  environment: \"production\"\n}\n```\n\n### nested Property\n\nRelated entities captured together.\n\n```typescript\n// Order with line items\nnested: [\n  { type: ''product'', data: { id: ''P1'', quantity: 2 } },\n  { type: ''product'', data: { id: ''P2'', quantity: 1 } },\n];\n```\n\n### user Property\n\nUser identification across sessions.\n\n```typescript\nuser: {\n  id: \"user123\",        // Your user ID\n  device: \"device456\",  // Device fingerprint\n  session: \"sess789\"    // Session ID\n}\n```\n\n## Design Principles\n\n### Statelessness\n\nEvents are immutable snapshots. They don''t reference previous events or maintain\nstate.\n\n### Self-Describing\n\nEvents contain all context needed to understand them. No external lookups\nrequired.\n\n### Vendor-Agnostic\n\nEvents use generic concepts (product, order) not vendor-specific (GA4 item, FB\ncontent).\n\nTransformation to vendor formats happens in **mapping**, not in event creation.\n\n## Creating Events\n\n```typescript\nimport { elb } from ''@walkeros/collector'';\n\n// Basic event\nawait elb(''page view'', { title: ''Home'', path: ''/'' });\n\n// With all properties\nawait elb(\n  ''product add'',\n  { id: ''P123'', price: 99 }, // data\n  { stage: [''cart'', 1] }, // context (optional)\n  { currency: ''USD'' }, // globals (optional)\n);\n```\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- [walkeros-understanding-mapping](../walkeros-understanding-mapping/SKILL.md) -\n  Transform events for destinations\n- [walkeros-understanding-flow](../walkeros-understanding-flow/SKILL.md) - Data\n  flow architecture\n\n**Source Files:**\n\n- [packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts](../../packages/core/src/types/walkeros.ts) -\n  Event types\n- [packages/core/src/schemas/](../../packages/core/src/schemas/) - Event schemas\n\n**Documentation:**\n\n- [Website: Event Model](../../website/docs/getting-started/event-model.mdx) -\n  User-facing docs\n- [walkeros.io/docs](https://www.walkeros.io/docs/) - Public documentation\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:23:32.884Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Stateful Agents needing standardized event data structures with entity-action naming conventions.","zh":"非常适合需要标准化事件数据结构和实体-操作命名约定的有状态代理。","ja":"状態を持つエージェントが標準化されたイベントデータ構造とエンティティアクション命名規則を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"표준화된 이벤트 데이터 구조와 엔티티-액션命명 규칙이 필요한 상태가 있는 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes con estado que necesitan estructuras de datos de eventos estandarizadas con convenciones de nomenclatura de entidad-acción.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents à état nécessitant des structures de données d''événement standardisées avec des conventions de dénomination d''entité-action.","de":"Perfekt für Zustandsagenten, die standardisierte Ereignisdatenstrukturen mit Entitäts-Aktions-Benennungskonventionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Stateful que necessitam de estruturas de dados de eventos padronizadas com convenções de nomenclatura de entidade-ação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Stateful, требующих стандартизированных структур данных событий с именованными конвенциями сущность-действие.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الدولة الذي يحتاج إلى هياكل بيانات الأحداث الموحدة مع اتفاقيات تسمية الكيان-الفعل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to capture user interactions in a self-describing, vendor-agnostic format using stateless events, enabling seamless data transformation for any destination with strict entity-action naming requirements.","zh":"赋予代理捕获用户交互的能力，使用无状态事件以自描述、厂商无关的格式进行捕获，使得任何具有严格实体-操作命名要求的目的地都能无缝地转换数据。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーとのやり取りを、自己記述的でベンダー非依存の形式でステートレスイベントを使用してキャプチャする能力を提供し、厳格なエンティティアクション命名要件を持つ任意の宛先に対してデータ変換をシームレスに行えるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자 상호작용을 자체적으로 설명하고 벤더 중립적인 형식으로 상태가 없는 이벤트를 사용하여 캡처할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여, 엄격한 엔티티-액션命명 요구 사항을 가진 任意의 대상에 대한 데이터 변환을 무결점으로 수행할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a capturar las interacciones de los usuarios en un formato autodescriptivo y agnóstico de proveedor utilizando eventos sin estado, lo que permite una transformación de datos sin problemas para cualquier destino con requisitos estrictos de nomenclatura de entidad-acción.","fr":"Permet aux agents de capturer les interactions utilisateur dans un format autodescriptif et indépendant du fournisseur en utilisant des événements sans état, ce qui permet une transformation de données transparente pour toute destination ayant des exigences de nommage d''entité-action strictes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Benutzerinteraktionen in einem selbstbeschreibenden, herstellerunabhängigen Format unter Verwendung von zustandslosen Ereignissen zu erfassen, wodurch eine nahtlose Datentransformation für jedes Ziel mit strengen Entitäts-Aktions-Benennungsvoraussetzungen ermöglicht wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a capturar interações do usuário em um formato auto-descritivo, independente de fornecedor, usando eventos stateless, permitindo uma transformação de dados sem problemas para qualquer destino com requisitos estritos de nomenclatura de entidade-ação.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью захватывать взаимодействия пользователя в самодостаточном, независимом от поставщика формате с использованием безсостояних событий, что позволяет легко преобразовывать данные для любого места назначения с жесткими требованиями к именованию сущность-действие.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التقاط تفاعلات المستخدم في تنسيق自و-واصف، مستقل عن البائع، باستخدام أحداث غير محددة، مما يسمح بالتحويل السلس للبيانات إلى أي وجهة ذات متطلبات صارمة لاتفاقيات تسمية الكيان-الفعل."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing event data for cross-platform analysis","Transforming events for multiple destinations","Enforcing entity-action naming conventions for consistency"],"zh":["跨平台分析的事件数据标准化","多个目标地的事件转换","一致性实体-操作命名规则的强制"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォーム分析のためのイベントデータの標準化","複数の宛先へのイベントの変換","一貫性のあるエンティティアクション命名規則の強制"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 분석을 위한 이벤트 데이터 표준화","여러 목적지에 대한 이벤트 변환","일관된 엔티티-액션命명 규칙의 적용"],"es":["Estandarizar datos de eventos para análisis entre plataformas","Transformar eventos para múltiples destinos","Aplicar convenciones de nomenclatura de entidad-acción para la consistencia"],"fr":["Standardiser les données d''événement pour l''analyse entre les plateformes","Transformer les événements pour plusieurs destinations","Appliquer les conventions de nommage d''entité-action pour la cohérence"],"de":["Ereignisdaten für die Analyse zwischen Plattformen standardisieren","Ereignisse für mehrere Ziele transformieren","Entitäts-Aktions-Benennungskonventionen für die Konsistenz durchsetzen"],"pt":["Padronizar dados de eventos para análise cross-plataforma","Transformar eventos para vários destinos","Impor convenções de nomenclatura de entidade-ação para consistência"],"ru":["Стандартизировать данные событий для анализа на нескольких платформах","Преобразовывать события для нескольких пунктов назначения","Внедрять конвенции именования сущность-действие для согласованности"],"ar":["توحيد بيانات الأحداث للتحليل عبر المنصات","تحويل الأحداث إلى عدة وجهات","فرض اتفاقيات تسمية الكيان-الفعل من أجل الاتساق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires strict adherence to entity-action naming format with space separation","Stateless events may not be suitable for applications requiring event history or context"],"zh":["需要严格遵守实体-操作命名格式，需要空格分隔","无状态事件可能不适合需要事件历史或上下文的应用"],"ja":["エンティティアクション命名フォーマットの厳格な遵守が必要で、空白による区切りが必要","ステートレスイベントは、イベント履歴またはコンテキストが必要なアプリケーションには不適切である可能性がある"],"ko":["엔티티-액션命명 형식의 엄격한 준수가 필요하며, 공백으로 구분해야 함","무상태 이벤트는 이벤트 기록 또는 컨텍스트가 필요한 애플리케이션에 적합하지 않을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere una estricta adhesión al formato de nomenclatura de entidad-acción con separación de espacios","Los eventos sin estado pueden no ser adecuados para aplicaciones que requieren historial o contexto de eventos"],"fr":["Nécessite une adhésion stricte au format de nommage d''entité-action avec séparation d''espaces","Les événements sans état peuvent ne pas convenir aux applications nécessitant l''historique ou le contexte des événements"],"de":["Erfordert eine strikte Einhaltung des Entitäts-Aktions-Benennungsformats mit Leerzeichen-Trennung","Zustandslose Ereignisse sind möglicherweise nicht geeignet für Anwendungen, die ein Ereignishistorie oder -kontext erfordern"],"pt":["Exige adesão estrita ao formato de nomenclatura de entidade-ação com separação de espaço","Eventos stateless podem não ser adequados para aplicações que exigem histórico ou contexto de eventos"],"ru":["Требует строгого соблюдения формата именования сущность-действие с разделением пробелом","Безсостояние события могут быть не подходящими для приложений, требующих истории или контекста событий"],"ar":["يتطلب الالتزام الصارم بتنسيق تسمية الكيان-الفعل مع فصل الفراغ","الأحداث غير المحددة قد لا تكون مناسبة للتطبيقات التي تتطلب تاريخ أو سياق للأحداث"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0a9fff852cbf7e80db58ffb7aa2a1a642fed7de50235d1f89a6cd61af147494d","qualityScore":30}');
