l that generates tax reports for Slovenia''s Tax Authority, utilizing specific details and schemas such as TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes","zh":"Slovenian Tax EDavki AIエージェント是一种用于生成税务报告的工具","ja":"Slovenian Tax EDavki AIエージェントは税務報告書を生成するツール","ko":"Slovenian Tax EDavki AI 툴은税務보고서를 생성하는 도구","es":"EDavki es una herramienta de inteligencia artificial para la generación de informes de impuestos eslovenos","fr":"EDavki est un outil d''intelligence artificielle pour la génération de rapports d''impôts slovènes","de":"EDavki ist ein KI-Tool für die Erstellung von slowenischen Steuerberichten","pt":"O que é o skill de impostos esloveno EDavki? É um conjunto de tecnologias que geram relatórios de impostos para a autoridade fiscal eslovena.","ru":"Что такое навык налогов Словении EDavki? Это набор технологий, который генерирует отчеты о налогах для налоговой службы Словении.","ar":"ما هي مهارة الضريبة السلوفينية EDavki؟ هي مجموعة من التكنولوجيا التي توليد تقارير ضريبية للسلطات الضريبية السلوفينية."},"features":{"en":["Generates tax reports for Slovenia''s Tax Authority using EDavki-specific details","Implements report types such as DOH_DIV for dividend income","Utilizes TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes for report generation","Supports pipeline-and-structure and infoproviders-lookup-data skills for enhanced functionality","Provides Slovenian label and use information for each report type"],"zh":["支持DOH_DIV报告类型","集成TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes","使用Python和CLI进行开发","支持Edavki和IBKR税务报告","提供SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes报告类型","使用pipeline-and-structure和infoproviders-lookup-data技能"],"ja":["DOH_DIVレポートタイプをサポート","TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypesを統合","PythonとCLIを使用して開発","EdavkiとIBKR税務レポートをサポート","SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypesレポートタイプを提供","pipeline-and-structureとinfoproviders-lookup-dataスキルを使用"],"ko":["DOH_DIV 보고서 유형 지원","TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes 통합","Python과 CLI를 사용하여 개발","Edavki와 IBKR税務 보고서 지원","SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes 보고서 유형 제공","pipeline-and-structure와 infoproviders-lookup-data 스킬 사용"],"es":["Generación de informes de impuestos para la autoridad fiscal eslovena","Soporte para tipos de informes como DOH_DIV","Integración con habilidades genéricas como pipeline-and-structure y infoproviders-lookup-data","Detalles específicos para Slovenia y EDavki","Implementación en TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes"],"fr":["Génération de rapports d''impôts pour l''administration fiscale slovène","Prise en charge de types de rapports tels que DOH_DIV","Intégration avec des compétences génériques comme pipeline-and-structure et infoproviders-lookup-data","Détails spécifiques pour la Slovénie et EDavki","Implémentation en TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes"],"de":["Erstellung von Steuerberichten für die slowenische Finanzbehörde","Unterstützung für Berichtstypen wie DOH_DIV","Integration mit generischen Fähigkeiten wie pipeline-and-structure und infoproviders-lookup-data","Spezifische Details für Slowenien und EDavki","Implementierung in TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes"],"pt":["Geração de relatórios de impostos para a autoridade fiscal eslovena","Uso de tecnologias como pipeline-and-structure e infoproviders-lookup-data","Suporte a relatórios de dividendos (DOH_DIV)","Integração com a plataforma IBKR","Compatibilidade com o skill de impostos genérico"],"ru":["Генерация отчетов о налогах для налоговой службы Словении","Использование технологий как pipeline-and-structure и infoproviders-lookup-data","Поддержка отчетов о дивидендах (DOH_DIV)","Интеграция с платформой IBKR","Совместимость с навыком налогов общего назначения"],"ar":["توليد تقارير ضريبية للسلطات الضريبية السلوفينية","استخدام تقنيات مثل pipeline-and-structure و infoproviders-lookup-data","دعم تقارير الأرباح (DOH_DIV)","التكامل مع منصة IBKR","التوافق مع مهارة الضريبة العامة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use slovenian-tax-edavki","slovenian-tax-edavki setup guide","slovenian-tax-edavki alternative","what is slovenian-tax-edavki","slovenian-tax-edavki install","slovenian-tax-edavki vs ibkr","edavki tax reporting","slovenian tax authority reporting"],"zh":["Slovenian Tax EDavki AIエージェント","税务报告生成","DOH_DIV报告类型","TaxAuthorityProvider","Edavki税务报告","IBKR税务报告","Python开发","CLI开发","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Slovenian Tax EDavki AIエージェント","税務レポート生成","DOH_DIVレポートタイプ","TaxAuthorityProvider","Edavki税務レポート","IBKR税務レポート","Python開発","CLI開発","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Slovenian Tax EDavki AI 툴","税務보고서 생성","DOH_DIV 보고서 유형","TaxAuthorityProvider","Edavki税務 보고서","IBKR税務 보고서","Python 개발","CLI 개발","AI 툴"],"es":["EDavki","impuestos eslovenos","informes de impuestos","autoridad fiscal eslovena","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","generación de informes","tipos de informes","DOH_DIV","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data"],"fr":["EDavki","impôts slovènes","rapports d''impôts","administration fiscale slovène","outils d''intelligence artificielle","génération de rapports","types de rapports","DOH_DIV","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data"],"de":["EDavki","slowenische Steuern","Steuerberichte","slowenische Finanzbehörde","KI-Tools","Erstellung von Steuerberichten","Berichtstypen","DOH_DIV","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data"],"pt":["impostos eslovenos","EDavki","relatórios de impostos","autoridade fiscal eslovena","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data","IBKR","dividendos","DOH_DIV"],"ru":["налоги Словении","EDavki","отчеты о налогах","налоговая служба Словении","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data","IBKR","дивиденды","DOH_DIV"],"ar":["الضريبة السلوفينية","EDavki","تقارير ضريبية","السلطات الضريبية السلوفينية","pipeline-and-structure","infoproviders-lookup-data","IBKR","الأرباح","DOH_DIV"]}},"owner":"MarjanDB","repo":"brrr-generator","repoPath":"MarjanDB/brrr-generator","stars":7,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-18T09:31:29Z","topics":["edavki","ibkr","taxes"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"slovenian-tax-edavki","description":"Slovenian tax reporting and EDavki forms (DOH_DIV, DOH_KDVP, D_IFI, DOH_OBR). Use when working on Slovenia tax authority provider, EDavki XML/CSV generation, userConfig.yml taxpayer fields, or Slovenian report types and XSDs.","bodyPreview":"# Slovenian tax and EDavki\n\nUse alongside generic skills (pipeline-and-structure, infoproviders-lookup-data); this skill adds Slovenia/EDavki-specific details.\n\n## Report types\n\nImplemented in `TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes`:\n\n| Report type  | Slovenian label               | Use                 |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **DOH_DIV**  | Dividende                     | Dividend incom","body":"# Slovenian tax and EDavki\n\nUse alongside generic skills (pipeline-and-structure, infoproviders-lookup-data); this skill adds Slovenia/EDavki-specific details.\n\n## Report types\n\nImplemented in `TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.Schemas.ReportTypes.SlovenianTaxAuthorityReportTypes`:\n\n| Report type  | Slovenian label               | Use                 |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| **DOH_DIV**  | Dividende                     | Dividend income     |\n| **DOH_KDVP** | Vrednostni papirji            | Securities / shares |\n| **D_IFI**    | Izvedeni finančni inštrumenti | Derivatives         |\n| **DOH_OBR**  | Obresti                       | Interest            |\n\n## Notebook ↔ report mapping\n\n| Notebook                            | Report type | Lot matching | Date range (example) |\n| ----------------------------------- | ----------- | ------------ | -------------------- |\n| `notebooks/dividends.ipynb`         | DOH_DIV     | NONE         | 2025–2026            |\n| `notebooks/stock trades.ipynb`      | DOH_KDVP    | FIFO         | 2024–2025            |\n| `notebooks/derivative trades.ipynb` | D_IFI       | FIFO         | 2025–2026            |\n\nOutput files: `Doh_Div_3.xml`, `Doh_KDVP_9.xml`, `D_IFI_4.xml` (and corresponding CSV exports in `exports/`).\n\n## EDavki document workflow types\n\nUsed for submission metadata. Defined in `ReportTypes.EDavkiDocumentWorkflowType` (see [EDavki help](https://edavki.durs.si/EdavkiPortal/PersonalPortal/[360253]/Pages/Help/sl/WorkflowType1.htm)):\n\n- ORIGINAL, SETTLEMENT*ZDAVP2*\\_, CORRECTION\\_\\_, SELF_REPORT, CANCELLED, etc.\n\n## Taxpayer config (userConfig.yml)\n\n`config/userConfig.yml` is read by `ConfigurationProvider` and mapped to **TaxPayerInfo** (`ConfigurationProvider.Configuration`). Slovenian-oriented fields and defaults:\n\n- **taxNumber**, **taxPayerType** (FO / PO / SP), **name**, **address1**, **address2**, **city**\n- **postOfficeNumber** → postNumber, **postOfficeName** → postName, **municipality**\n- **birthday** → birthDate, **identity** → maticnaStevilka, **company** → invalidskoPodjetje, **resident**\n- Default **countryID** \"SI\", **countryName** \"Slovenia\"\n\n## XSDs and report generation\n\n- **XSDs:** `src/TaxAuthorityProvider/TaxAuthorities/Slovenia/XmlSchemas/` (e.g. `Doh_Div_3.xsd`, `Doh_KDVP_9.xsd`, `D_IFI_4.xsd`, `Doh_Obr_2.xsd`, `EDP-Common-1.xsd`).\n- **Report generation:** `TaxAuthorityProvider.TaxAuthorities.Slovenia.ReportGeneration/` with subfolders DIV, KDVP, IFI (Common, CSV*\\*, XML*\\*).\n\n## EDavki vs broker P/L\n\nSlovenia uses **trade price** (1% of trade price as costs), not cost basis. When comparing with IBKR exports: take realized P/L and add commissions; generated reports can show higher gains than broker statements. See comments in `ReportGeneration/KDVP/CSV_Doh_KDVP.py` and `ReportGeneration/IFI/CSV_D_IFI.py`.\n\n## InfoProviders and Slovenia\n\nCountry/treaty and company lookups used by the Slovenia provider rely on:\n\n- `src/InfoProviders/internationalTreaties.json` – tax treaties (e.g. tax relief).\n- `src/InfoProviders/specialCountryMappings.json` – country name/code overrides.\n- `src/InfoProviders/missingCompaniesLookup.json`, `missingISINLookup.json` – fallbacks when ISIN/company resolution fails (helps avoid \"Failed processing stock lot\" where the cause is missing or wrong identifier).\n\nReferences: [MF list of treaties](https://www.gov.si/drzavni-organi/ministrstva/ministrstvo-za-finance/o-ministrstvu/direktorat-za-sistem-davcnih-carinskih-in-drugih-javnih-prihodkov/seznam-veljavnih-konvencij-o-izogibanju-dvojnega-obdavcevanja-dohodka-in-premozenja/), [FURS international tax](https://www.fu.gov.si/davki_in_druge_dajatve/podrocja/mednarodno_obdavcenje/#c78).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T01:52:28.384Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Financial Analysis Agents needing automated Slovenian tax report generation for brokerage accounts.","zh":"适用于需要自动为券商账户生成斯洛文尼亚税务报告的金融分析代理","ja":"金融分析エージェントが証券口座のスロベニア税務報告書を自動生成する必要がある場合に適しています","ko":"증권 계좌의 슬로베니아 세금 보고서를 자동 생성해야 하는 금융 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis Financiero que necesitan generar informes de impuestos eslovenos automatizados para cuentas de corretaje.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse financière ayant besoin de générer des rapports d''impôts slovènes automatisés pour les comptes de courtage.","de":"Perfekt für Finanzanalyse-Agents, die automatisierte slowenische Steuererklärungen für Maklerkonten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Financeira que necessitam de geração automática de relatórios de impostos eslovenos para contas de corretagem.","ru":"Идеально подходит для финансовых аналитических агентов, которым требуется автоматизированная генерация словенских налоговых отчетов для брокерских счетов.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التحليل المالي الذين يحتاجون إلى توليد تلقائي لتقرير الضريبة السلوفينية لحسابات الوساطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive tax reports for Slovenia''s Tax Authority using EDavki-specific details, implementing report types like DOH_DIV for dividend income, and leveraging TaxAuthorityProvider schemas.","zh":"赋予代理生成斯洛文尼亚税务局的综合税务报告，使用EDavki特定细节，实现像DOH_DIV用于股息收入的报告类型，并利用TaxAuthorityProvider模式","ja":"エージェントがスロベニア税務局のための包括的な税務報告書を生成できるようにし、EDavki特有の詳細を使用し、DOH_DIVのような報告書タイプを実装し、TaxAuthorityProviderスキーマを利用する","ko":"에이전트가 슬로베니아 세무 당국의 종합 세금 보고서를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, EDavki 특정 세부 사항을 사용하고, 배당 소득을 위한 DOH_DIV 같은 보고서 유형을 구현하며, TaxAuthorityProvider 스키마를 활용합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar informes de impuestos completos para la Autoridad Tributaria de Eslovenia utilizando detalles específicos de EDavki, implementando tipos de informes como DOH_DIV para ingresos por dividendos y aprovechando los esquemas de TaxAuthorityProvider.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des rapports d''impôts complets pour l''Autorité fiscale slovène en utilisant des détails spécifiques à EDavki, en mettant en œuvre des types de rapports tels que DOH_DIV pour les revenus de dividendes et en exploitant les schémas de TaxAuthorityProvider.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, umfassende Steuererklärungen für die slowenische Steuerbehörde zu generieren, indem sie EDavki-spezifische Details verwenden, Berichtstypen wie DOH_DIV für Dividenden-Einkommen implementieren und TaxAuthorityProvider-Schemata nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar relatórios de impostos abrangentes para a Autoridade Tributária da Eslovênia usando detalhes específicos do EDavki, implementando tipos de relatórios como DOH_DIV para renda de dividendos, e aproveitando esquemas do TaxAuthorityProvider.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полные налоговые отчеты для словенской налоговой власти, используя подробности, специфичные для EDavki, реализуя типы отчетов, такие как DOH_DIV для дохода от дивидендов, и использует схемы TaxAuthorityProvider.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من توليد تقارير ضريبية شاملة لسلطة الضرائب السلوفينية باستخدام تفاصيل محددة لبرنامج EDavki، وتنفيذ أنواع تقارير مثل DOH_DIV لمداخيل الأرباح، وتوظيف مخططات TaxAuthorityProvider."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tax reporting for Slovenian brokerage accounts","Generating EDavki-compliant reports for dividend income","Validating tax report data against Slovenian Tax Authority requirements"],"zh":["自动为斯洛文尼亚券商账户生成税务报告","为股息收入生成符合EDavki的报告","验证税务报告数据是否符合斯洛文尼亚税务局的要求"],"ja":["スロベニア証券口座の税務報告書を自動生成する","EDavkiに準拠した報告書を生成する","税務報告書データをスロベニア税務局の要件と照合する"],"ko":["슬로베니아 증권 계좌의 세금 보고서를 자동 생성","배당 소득에 대한 EDavki 규격의 보고서 생성","세금 보고서 데이터를 슬로베니아 세무 당국의 요구사항과 검증"],"es":["Automatizar la presentación de informes de impuestos para cuentas de corretaje eslovenas","Generar informes compatibles con EDavki para ingresos por dividendos","Validar los datos de los informes de impuestos contra los requisitos de la Autoridad Tributaria eslovena"],"fr":["Automatiser la déclaration d''impôts pour les comptes de courtage slovènes","Générer des rapports conformes à EDavki pour les revenus de dividendes","Valider les données des rapports d''impôts par rapport aux exigences de l''Autorité fiscale slovène"],"de":["Automatisieren der Steuererklärung für slowenische Maklerkonten","Generieren von EDavki-konformen Berichten für Dividenden-Einkommen","Validieren der Steuererklärungsdaten gegen die Anforderungen der slowenischen Steuerbehörde"],"pt":["Automatizar a emissão de relatórios de impostos para contas de corretagem eslovenas","Gerar relatórios compatíveis com o EDavki para renda de dividendos","Validar dados de relatórios de impostos contra os requisitos da Autoridade Tributária da Eslovênia"],"ru":["Автоматизировать выпуск налоговых отчетов для словенских брокерских счетов","Генерировать отчеты, совместимые с EDavki, для дохода от дивидендов","Проверять данные налоговых отчетов на соответствие требованиям словенской налоговой власти"],"ar":["أتمتة إصدار تقارير الضرائب لحسابات الوساطة السلوفينية","توليد تقارير متوافقة مع برنامج EDavki لمداخيل الأرباح","التحقق من بيانات تقارير الضرائب مقابل متطلبات سلطة الضرائب السلوفينية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Slovenian tax regulations","Specific to Slovenia''s Tax Authority and EDavki system"],"zh":["需要了解斯洛文尼亚税务法规","仅适用于斯洛文尼亚税务局和EDavki系统"],"ja":["スロベニア税務規則の知識が必要","スロベニア税務局とEDavkiシステムの特有"],"ko":["슬로베니아 세법 규정을 알아야 함","슬로베니아 세무 당국 및 EDavki 시스템 전용"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las regulaciones fiscales eslovenas","Específico para la Autoridad Tributaria de Eslovenia y el sistema EDavki"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des réglementations fiscales slovènes","Spécifique à l''Autorité fiscale slovène et au système EDavki"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der slowenischen Steuervorschriften","Spezifisch für die slowenische Steuerbehörde und das EDavki-System"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das regulamentações fiscais eslovenas","Específico para a Autoridade Tributária da Eslovênia e o sistema EDavki"],"ru":["Требует знания словенских налоговых правил","Относится конкретно к словенской налоговой власти и системе EDavki"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة اللوائح الضريبية السلوفينية","محدد لسلطة الضرائب السلوفينية ونظام EDavki"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"10c91b29928030947d16e0a36da1b013aaca409c511ac33363f53eac4a72c7a1","qualityScore":29}');
