ure value and drive growth by aligning prices with customer willingness to pay.","zh":"Pricing Strategy是指设计和实施SaaS产品的定价和盈利策略，以最大化收入和客户满意度","ja":"Pricing Strategyは、SaaS製品の価格設定と収益化戦略を設計し、実施することを指し、収益と顧客満足度の最大化を目指す","ko":"Pricing Strategy는 SaaS 제품의 가격 설정과 수익화 전략을 설계하고 구현하여 수익과 고객 만족도를 최대화하는 것을 의미합니다","es":"La estrategia de precios es el proceso de diseño de precios para capturar valor y estimular el crecimiento en un negocio SaaS","fr":"La stratégie de tarification est le processus de conception de prix pour capter la valeur et stimuler la croissance dans une entreprise SaaS","de":"Die Preisstrategie ist der Prozess der Preisgestaltung, um den Wert zu erfassen und das Wachstum in einem SaaS-Unternehmen zu fördern","pt":"Estratégia de preços é uma abordagem para definir preços de produtos ou serviços que equilibrem a receita e o crescimento","ru":"Стратегия ценообразования - это подход к определению цен на продукты или услуги, который балансирует доход и рост","ar":"استراتيجية التسعير هي نهج لتحديد أسعار المنتجات أو الخدمات التي توازن الإيرادات والنمو"},"features":{"en":["Checks for product marketing context in .claude/product-marketing-context.md","Gathers business context to inform pricing decisions","Designs pricing that captures value and drives growth","Aligns prices with customer willingness to pay","Supports SaaS pricing and monetization strategy development"],"zh":["根据产品营销背景设计定价策略","考虑客户的支付意愿和产品价值","设计合理的SaaS定价和盈利策略","使用CLI工具优化定价策略","结合React和Python技术开发定价模型"],"ja":["製品マーケティングの背景を考慮した価格設定戦略の設計","顧客の支払い意欲と製品の価値を考慮","最適なSaaS価格設定と収益化戦略の設計","CLIツールを使用した価格設定戦略の最適化","ReactとPython技術を使用した価格モデル開発"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 배경을 고려한 가격 설정 전략 설계","고객의 지불 의향과 제품 가치를 고려","합리적인 SaaS 가격 설정과 수익화 전략 설계","CLI 도구를 사용한 가격 설정 전략 최적화","React와 Python 기술을 사용한 가격 모델 개발"],"es":["Análisis de la voluntad de pago de los clientes","Diseño de precios que capturan valor","Estrategias de monetización para SaaS","Integración con el contexto de marketing de productos","Optimización de precios para impulsar el crecimiento"],"fr":["Analyse de la volonté de payer des clients","Conception de prix qui capturent la valeur","Stratégies de monétisation pour les logiciels SaaS","Intégration avec le contexte de marketing de produits","Optimisation des prix pour stimuler la croissance"],"de":["Analyse der Zahlungsbereitschaft der Kunden","Gestaltung von Preisen, die den Wert erfassen","Monetarisierungsstrategien für SaaS","Integration mit dem Produktmarketing-Kontext","Preisoptimierung zur Förderung des Wachstums"],"pt":["Análise de contexto de marketing de produtos","Definição de preços baseada em valor","Otimização de receita e crescimento","Integração com estratégias de monetização","Análise de disposição do cliente para pagar"],"ru":["Анализ контекста маркетинга продукта","Определение цен на основе стоимости","Оптимизация дохода и роста","Интеграция со стратегиями монетизации","Анализ готовности клиента платить"],"ar":["تحليل سياق تسويق المنتجات","تحديد الأسعار على أساس القيمة","تحسين الإيرادات والنمو","التكامل مع استراتيجيات توليد الإيرادات","تحليل استعداد الزبون لدفع الثمن"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use pricing-strategy","what is pricing-strategy","pricing-strategy alternative","pricing-strategy vs competitor","pricing-strategy install","pricing-strategy setup guide","SaaS pricing strategy","monetization strategy for SaaS","customer willingness to pay"],"zh":["Pricing Strategy","SaaS定价","盈利策略","AIエージェント","产品营销背景","CLI工具","React","Python"],"ja":["Pricing Strategy","SaaS価格設定","収益化戦略","AIエージェント","製品マーケティングの背景","CLIツール","React","Python"],"ko":["Pricing Strategy","SaaS 가격 설정","수익화 전략","AI Tools","제품 마케팅 배경","CLI 도구","React","Python"],"es":["estrategia de precios SaaS","monetización de software","tarificación de productos","análisis de voluntad de pago","diseño de precios efectivo","crecimiento de negocio SaaS","herramientas de AI para precios"],"fr":["stratégie de tarification SaaS","monétisation de logiciels","tarification de produits","analyse de la volonté de payer","conception de prix efficace","croissance d''entreprise SaaS","outils d''IA pour les prix"],"de":["Preisstrategie SaaS","Monetarisierung von Software","Preisgestaltung von Produkten","Analyse der Zahlungsbereitschaft","effektive Preisgestaltung","Wachstum von SaaS-Unternehmen","KI-Tools für Preise"],"pt":["estratégia de preços saas","preços baseados em valor","monetização de saas","análise de contexto de marketing","otimização de receita","crescimento de saas","preços de produtos","estratégias de preços"],"ru":["стратегия ценообразования saas","цены на основе стоимости","монетизация saas","анализ контекста маркетинга","оптимизация дохода","рост saas","цены на продукты","стратегии ценообразования"],"ar":["استراتيجية التسعير لبرامج الحاسوب كخدمة","أسعار على أساس القيمة","توليد الإيرادات لبرامج الحاسوب كخدمة","تحليل سياق تسويق المنتجات","تحسين الإيرادات","نمو برامج الحاسوب كخدمة","أسعار المنتجات","استراتيجيات التسعير"]}},"owner":"jaydubya818","repo":"Dental_Agent","repoPath":"jaydubya818/Dental_Agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T17:47:20Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pricing-strategy","description":"When the user wants help with pricing decisions, packaging, or monetization strategy. Also use when the user mentions pricing, pricing tiers, freemium, free trial, packaging, price increase, value metric, Van Westendorp, willingness to pay, or monetization. This skill covers pricing research, tier structure, and packaging strategy.","bodyPreview":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Busines","body":"# Pricing Strategy\n\nYou are an expert in SaaS pricing and monetization strategy. Your goal is to help design pricing that captures value, drives growth, and aligns with customer willingness to pay.\n\n## Before Starting\n\n**Check for product marketing context first:**\nIf `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` exists, read it before asking questions. Use that context and only ask for information not already covered or specific to this task.\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Business Context\n- What type of product? (SaaS, marketplace, e-commerce, service)\n- What''s your current pricing (if any)?\n- What''s your target market? (SMB, mid-market, enterprise)\n- What''s your go-to-market motion? (self-serve, sales-led, hybrid)\n\n### 2. Value & Competition\n- What''s the primary value you deliver?\n- What alternatives do customers consider?\n- How do competitors price?\n\n### 3. Current Performance\n- What''s your current conversion rate?\n- What''s your ARPU and churn rate?\n- Any feedback on pricing from customers/prospects?\n\n### 4. Goals\n- Optimizing for growth, revenue, or profitability?\n- Moving upmarket or expanding downmarket?\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Fundamentals\n\n### The Three Pricing Axes\n\n**1. Packaging** — What''s included at each tier?\n- Features, limits, support level\n- How tiers differ from each other\n\n**2. Pricing Metric** — What do you charge for?\n- Per user, per usage, flat fee\n- How price scales with value\n\n**3. Price Point** — How much do you charge?\n- The actual dollar amounts\n- Perceived value vs. cost\n\n### Value-Based Pricing\n\nPrice should be based on value delivered, not cost to serve:\n\n- **Customer''s perceived value** — The ceiling\n- **Your price** — Between alternatives and perceived value\n- **Next best alternative** — The floor for differentiation\n- **Your cost to serve** — Only a baseline, not the basis\n\n**Key insight:** Price between the next best alternative and perceived value.\n\n---\n\n## Value Metrics\n\n### What is a Value Metric?\n\nThe value metric is what you charge for—it should scale with the value customers receive.\n\n**Good value metrics:**\n- Align price with value delivered\n- Are easy to understand\n- Scale as customer grows\n- Are hard to game\n\n### Common Value Metrics\n\n| Metric | Best For | Example |\n|--------|----------|---------|\n| Per user/seat | Collaboration tools | Slack, Notion |\n| Per usage | Variable consumption | AWS, Twilio |\n| Per feature | Modular products | HubSpot add-ons |\n| Per contact/record | CRM, email tools | Mailchimp |\n| Per transaction | Payments, marketplaces | Stripe |\n| Flat fee | Simple products | Basecamp |\n\n### Choosing Your Value Metric\n\nAsk: \"As a customer uses more of [metric], do they get more value?\"\n- If yes → good value metric\n- If no → price doesn''t align with value\n\n---\n\n## Tier Structure Overview\n\n### Good-Better-Best Framework\n\n**Good tier (Entry):** Core features, limited usage, low price\n**Better tier (Recommended):** Full features, reasonable limits, anchor price\n**Best tier (Premium):** Everything, advanced features, 2-3x Better price\n\n### Tier Differentiation\n\n- **Feature gating** — Basic vs. advanced features\n- **Usage limits** — Same features, different limits\n- **Support level** — Email → Priority → Dedicated\n- **Access** — API, SSO, custom branding\n\n**For detailed tier structures and persona-based packaging**: See [references/tier-structure.md](references/tier-structure.md)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Research\n\n### Van Westendorp Method\n\nFour questions that identify acceptable price range:\n1. Too expensive (wouldn''t consider)\n2. Too cheap (question quality)\n3. Expensive but might consider\n4. A bargain\n\nAnalyze intersections to find optimal pricing zone.\n\n### MaxDiff Analysis\n\nIdentifies which features customers value most:\n- Show sets of features\n- Ask: Most important? Least important?\n- Results inform tier packaging\n\n**For detailed research methods**: See [references/research-methods.md](references/research-methods.md)\n\n---\n\n## When to Raise Prices\n\n### Signs It''s Time\n\n**Market signals:**\n- Competitors have raised prices\n- Prospects don''t flinch at price\n- \"It''s so cheap!\" feedback\n\n**Business signals:**\n- Very high conversion rates (>40%)\n- Very low churn (<3% monthly)\n- Strong unit economics\n\n**Product signals:**\n- Significant value added since last pricing\n- Product more mature/stable\n\n### Price Increase Strategies\n\n1. **Grandfather existing** — New price for new customers only\n2. **Delayed increase** — Announce 3-6 months out\n3. **Tied to value** — Raise price but add features\n4. **Plan restructure** — Change plans entirely\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Page Best Practices\n\n### Above the Fold\n- Clear tier comparison table\n- Recommended tier highlighted\n- Monthly/annual toggle\n- Primary CTA for each tier\n\n### Common Elements\n- Feature comparison table\n- Who each tier is for\n- FAQ section\n- Annual discount callout (17-20%)\n- Money-back guarantee\n- Customer logos/trust signals\n\n### Pricing Psychology\n- **Anchoring:** Show higher-priced option first\n- **Decoy effect:** Middle tier should be best value\n- **Charm pricing:** $49 vs. $50 (for value-focused)\n- **Round pricing:** $50 vs. $49 (for premium)\n\n---\n\n## Pricing Checklist\n\n### Before Setting Prices\n- [ ] Defined target customer personas\n- [ ] Researched competitor pricing\n- [ ] Identified your value metric\n- [ ] Conducted willingness-to-pay research\n- [ ] Mapped features to tiers\n\n### Pricing Structure\n- [ ] Chosen number of tiers\n- [ ] Differentiated tiers clearly\n- [ ] Set price points based on research\n- [ ] Created annual discount strategy\n- [ ] Planned enterprise/custom tier\n\n---\n\n## Task-Specific Questions\n\n1. What pricing research have you done?\n2. What''s your current ARPU and conversion rate?\n3. What''s your primary value metric?\n4. Who are your main pricing personas?\n5. Are you self-serve, sales-led, or hybrid?\n6. What pricing changes are you considering?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **page-cro**: For optimizing pricing page conversion\n- **copywriting**: For pricing page copy\n- **marketing-psychology**: For pricing psychology principles\n- **ab-test-setup**: For testing pricing changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T03:43:59.845Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for SaaS-focused AI Agents requiring data-driven pricing strategy optimization.","zh":"适合需要数据驱动定价策略优化的SaaS焦点AI代理。","ja":"SaaS中心のAIエージェントがデータ駆動型の価格戦略最適化を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"데이터 주도형 가격 전략 최적화를 필요로 하는 SaaS 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial enfocados en SaaS que requieren una estrategia de optimización de precios basada en datos.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur le SaaS nécessitant une optimisation de la stratégie de tarification basée sur les données.","de":"Ideal für SaaS-fokussierte KI-Agents, die eine datengetriebene Preisstrategie-Optimierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA focados em SaaS que exigem otimização de estratégia de preços baseada em dados.","ru":"Идеально для AI-агентов, ориентированных на SaaS, требующих оптимизации стратегии ценообразования на основе данных.","ar":"مثالي لعميل إِي القائم على السحابة والمتطلب لتحسين استراتيجية التسعير القائمة على البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design pricing that captures value and drives growth by aligning with customer willingness to pay, utilizing product marketing context and SaaS monetization strategies.","zh":"赋予代理人设计价格的能力，以捕获价值并通过与客户支付意愿保持一致、利用产品营销背景和SaaS货币化策略来驱动增长。","ja":"エージェントが価値を捉え、成長を促進する価格を設計する能力を与え、顧客の支払い意欲と一致させ、製品マーケティングのコンテキストとSaaSの収益化戦略を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 가치를 포착하고 성장률을 끌어올리기 위한 가격을 설계할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 고객의 지불 의지와 일치시키고, 제품 마케팅 상황과 SaaS 매onetization 전략을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar precios que capturan valor y impulsan el crecimiento alineándose con la voluntad de pago del cliente, utilizando el contexto de marketing de productos y estrategias de monetización de SaaS.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des tarifs qui capturent la valeur et stimulent la croissance en s''alignant sur la volonté de payer du client, en utilisant le contexte de marketing de produits et les stratégies de monétisation de SaaS.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Preise zu entwerfen, die Wert erfassen und Wachstum vorantreiben, indem sie mit der Zahlungsbereitschaft des Kunden übereinstimmen, unter Nutzung des Produktmarketing-Kontexts und der SaaS-Monetarisierungsstrategien.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar preços que capturam o valor e impulsionam o crescimento, alinhando-se com a disposição do cliente em pagar, utilizando o contexto de marketing de produtos e estratégias de monetização de SaaS.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать ценообразование, которое захватывает ценность и стимулирует рост, выравниваясь с готовностью клиента платить, используя контекст маркетинга продукта и стратегии монетизации SaaS.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تصميم التسعير الذي يلتقط القيمة ويدفع النمو من خلال الانحياز لإرادة العميل في الدفع، واستخدام سياق تسويق المنتج واستراتيجيات تحقيق الإيرادات من السحابة."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing customer willingness to pay for SaaS products","Designing optimal pricing strategies for growth","Aligning pricing with product marketing context"],"zh":["分析SaaS产品的客户支付意愿","设计最优价格策略以实现增长","将价格与产品营销背景保持一致"],"ja":["SaaS製品の顧客の支払い意欲を分析する","成長のための最適な価格戦略を設計する","価格を製品マーケティングのコンテキストと一致させる"],"ko":["SaaS 제품의 고객 지불 의지를 분석하여","성장률을 위한 최적의 가격 전략을 설계하여","가격을 제품 마케팅 상황과 일치시키는 것"],"es":["Análisis de la voluntad de pago del cliente para productos SaaS","Diseño de estrategias de precios óptimas para el crecimiento","Alineación de precios con el contexto de marketing de productos"],"fr":["Analyse de la volonté de payer du client pour les produits SaaS","Conception de stratégies de tarification optimales pour la croissance","Alignement des tarifs sur le contexte de marketing de produits"],"de":["Analyse der Zahlungsbereitschaft des Kunden für SaaS-Produkte","Entwurf optimaler Preisstrategien für das Wachstum","Ausrichtung der Preise mit dem Produktmarketing-Kontext"],"pt":["Analisar a disposição do cliente em pagar por produtos SaaS","Projetar estratégias de preços ótimas para crescimento","Alinhar preços com o contexto de marketing de produtos"],"ru":["Анализ готовности клиента платить за продукты SaaS","Проектирование оптимальных стратегий ценообразования для роста","Выравнивание цен с контекстом маркетинга продукта"],"ar":["تحليل استعداد العميل في الدفع مقابل منتجات السحابة","تصميم استراتيجيات تسعيرية مثالية للنمو","مواءمة الأسعار مع سياق تسويق المنتج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires product marketing context","Specific to SaaS businesses"],"zh":["需要产品营销背景","仅适用于SaaS业务"],"ja":["製品マーケティングのコンテキストが必要","SaaSビジネスに特有"],"ko":["제품 마케팅 상황이 필요","SaaS 비즈니스에만 특화"],"es":["Requiere contexto de marketing de productos","Específico para negocios de SaaS"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de marketing de produits","Spécifique aux entreprises de SaaS"],"de":["Benötigt Produktmarketing-Kontext","Spezifisch für SaaS-Geschäfte"],"pt":["Exige contexto de marketing de produtos","Específico para empresas de SaaS"],"ru":["Требует контекста маркетинга продукта","Спецефичен для бизнеса SaaS"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تسويق المنتج","محدد للأعمال التجارية السحابية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f48c1d2175eb63268f10867c4b57e078ab830ac463908d6121a62b4e35f83992","qualityScore":29}');
