، إطار عمل لجعل دوال Go خدمات ويب محمولة"},"definition":{"en":"create-specification is a skill that creates structured specification documents from user-provided ideas and requirements, utilizing a workflow with specific scripts and directory structures.","zh":"create-specification 是一种使用 Kuniumi 框架创建结构化规范文档的技能","ja":"create-specification は、Kuniumi フレームワークを使用して構造化された仕様書を作成するスキルです","ko":"create-specification 은 Kuniumi 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화된 규격 문서를 생성하는 기술입니다","es":"Create-specification es un skill de AI que crea especificaciones estructuradas para servicios web portátiles","fr":"Create-specification est un skill d''IA qui crée des spécifications structurées pour des services web portables","de":"Create-specification ist ein AI-Skill, der strukturierte Spezifikationen für portable Webdienste erstellt","pt":"O Create-Specification é um framework que cria especificações estruturadas para serviços web em Go","ru":"Create-Specification - это фреймворк, создающий структурированные спецификации для веб-сервисов на Go","ar":"Create-Specification هو إطار عمل لإنشاء مواصفات منظمة لخدمات الويب في Go"},"features":{"en":["Generates structured specification documents in Markdown format","Utilizes scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh for status checks","Extracts phase, branch, and next_idea_id from JSON output","Determines output location based on phase and directory structure","Supports creation of ideas and requirements in a portable format"],"zh":["使用 Kuniumi 框架创建结构化规范文档","支持 Go 语言函数的导出","通过 HTTP、CGI、MCP 和 Docker 容器等接口提供可移植的 Web 服务","创建规范文档的工作流程包括准备、目录确定和输出","使用 scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh 脚本获取当前状态","支持多阶段和分支的规范文档创建"],"ja":["Kuniumi フレームワークを使用して構造化された仕様書を作成","Go 言語関数のエクスポートをサポート","HTTP、CGI、MCP、Docker コンテナなど、さまざまなインターフェイスを介した可搬性のある Web サービスを提供","仕様書の作成ワークフローには、準備、ディレクトリの決定、出力が含まれる","scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh スクリプトを使用して現在の状態を取得","複数の段階とブランチの仕様書の作成をサポート"],"ko":["Kuniumi 프레임워크를 사용하여 구조화된 규격 문서를 생성","Go 언어 함수의导出을 지원","HTTP、CGI、MCP、Docker 컨테이너 등 다양한 인터페이스를 통해 可搬性의ある Web 서비스를 제공","규격 문서의 생성 워크플로우에는 준비、디렉토리 결정、출력이 포함","scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh 스크립트를 사용하여 현재 상태를 얻기","다중 단계와 브랜치의 규격 문서 생성을 지원"],"es":["Crea documentos de especificación estructurados en formato Markdown","Utiliza Go como lenguaje de programación para exponer funciones como servicios web","Soporta varios interfaces como HTTP, CGI, MCP y contenedores Docker","Permite la creación de especificaciones personalizadas según las necesidades del usuario","Incluye un flujo de trabajo de preparación para verificar el estado y el contexto"],"fr":["Crée des documents de spécification structurés au format Markdown","Utilise Go comme langage de programmation pour exposer des fonctions en tant que services web","Prend en charge diverses interfaces telles que HTTP, CGI, MCP et conteneurs Docker","Permet la création de spécifications personnalisées en fonction des besoins de l''utilisateur","Inclut un flux de travail de préparation pour vérifier l''état et le contexte"],"de":["Erstellt strukturierte Spezifikationsdokumente im Markdown-Format","Verwendet Go als Programmiersprache, um Funktionen als Webdienste bereitzustellen","Unterstützt verschiedene Schnittstellen wie HTTP, CGI, MCP und Docker-Container","Ermöglicht die Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Spezifikationen entsprechend den Anforderungen des Benutzers","Enthält einen Vorbereitungsworkflow, um den Status und den Kontext zu überprüfen"],"pt":["Criação de especificações estruturadas a partir de ideias e requisitos do usuário","Exposição de funções em Go como serviços web portáteis","Utilização de scripts de preparação para verificar status e contexto","Determinação de localização de saída com base na fase e ramo","Suporte a interfaces como HTTP, CGI, MCP e Docker containers"],"ru":["Создание структурированных спецификаций из идей и требований пользователя","Экспонирование функций на Go как веб-сервисов","Использование скриптов подготовки для проверки статуса и контекста","Определение местоположения вывода на основе фазы и ветки","Поддержка интерфейсов seperti HTTP, CGI, MCP и Docker контейнеров"],"ar":["إنشاء مواصفات منظمة من أفكار ومتطلبات المستخدم","تعرض دوال Go كخدمات ويب محمولة","استخدام سكريبتات التحضير لتحقق الحالة والسياق","تحديد موقع الإخراج بناءً على المرحلة والفرع","دعم واجهات مثل HTTP وCGI وMCP وحاويات Docker"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use create-specification","create-specification setup guide","what is create-specification","create-specification alternative","create-specification vs Kuniumi","create-specification install","generate structured specification documents","create-specification workflow creation","create-specification and Go language"],"zh":["Kuniumi 框架","create-specification 技能","Go 语言","结构化规范文档","可移植的 Web 服务","AIエージェント","技术文档创建"],"ja":["Kuniumi フレームワーク","create-specification スキル","Go 言語","構造化された仕様書","可搬性のある Web サービス","AIエージェント","技術文書の作成"],"ko":["Kuniumi 프레임워크","create-specification 기술","Go 언어","구조화된 규격 문서","可搬性의ある Web 서비스","AI 에이전트","기술 문서 생성"],"es":["create-specification","AI Agentes","desarrollo de servicios web","Go","HTTP","CGI","MCP","Docker","especificaciones estructuradas","Markdown"],"fr":["create-specification","Agents d''IA","développement de services web","Go","HTTP","CGI","MCP","Docker","spécifications structurées","Markdown"],"de":["create-specification","KI-Agents","Webdienst-Entwicklung","Go","HTTP","CGI","MCP","Docker","strukturierte Spezifikationen","Markdown"],"pt":["Create-Specification","Go language","serviços web portáteis","especificações estruturadas","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","frameworks para Go","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software"],"ru":["Create-Specification","Язык Go","веб-сервисы","структурированные спецификации","инструменты разработки","фреймворки для Go","разработка программного обеспечения","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["Create-Specification","لغة Go","خدمات ويب محمولة","مواصفات منظمة","أدوات التطوير","إطارات عمل ل Go","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"axsh","repo":"kuniumi","repoPath":"axsh/kuniumi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T12:23:44Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-specification","description":"Create a structured specification document from user ideas and requirements. Use when the user wants to create a spec, write a specification, document requirements, or start a new feature design.","bodyPreview":"# Create Specification Workflow\n\nThis skill creates a structured specification document (`.../ideas/.../XXX-{Name}.md`) from user-provided ideas and requirements.\n\n## 1. Preparation: Check Status and Context\n\n1. **Get status**:\n   - Run `scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh`.\n   - Extract `phase`, `branch`, `next_idea_id` from the JSON output.\n   - Refer to these as `[Phase]`, `[Branch]`, `[NextID]` below.\n\n## 2. Determine Output Location\n\n1. **Directory**:\n   - Base path: `prompts/phases/[Phase","body":"# Create Specification Workflow\n\nThis skill creates a structured specification document (`.../ideas/.../XXX-{Name}.md`) from user-provided ideas and requirements.\n\n## 1. Preparation: Check Status and Context\n\n1. **Get status**:\n   - Run `scripts/utils/show_current_status.sh`.\n   - Extract `phase`, `branch`, `next_idea_id` from the JSON output.\n   - Refer to these as `[Phase]`, `[Branch]`, `[NextID]` below.\n\n## 2. Determine Output Location\n\n1. **Directory**:\n   - Base path: `prompts/phases/[Phase]/ideas/[Branch]/`\n   - Example: `prompts/phases/001-webservices/ideas/main/`\n   - Create the directory if it does not exist.\n2. **File name**:\n   - Format: `[NextID]-[Name].md`\n   - `[Name]` should be a concise label that describes the spec (e.g. `Tokenizer`, `RateLimit-GlobalManagement`).\n\n## 3. Specification Content Structure\n\nThe specification must include at least the following sections:\n\n1. **Background**: Why this feature or change is needed. Current problems or challenges. May be omitted if unknown.\n2. **Requirements**: Features to implement and conditions to satisfy. Concrete behaviors and constraints. Clearly distinguish mandatory vs optional requirements.\n3. **Implementation Approach**: Technologies and architecture to use. Overview of major components/modules. Key design decisions.\n4. **Verification Scenarios**:\n   - **IMPORTANT (Preserve Details)**: If the user provides specific steps, conditions, or test scenarios (e.g. \"(1) do X then (2) do Y\"), transcribe them here at full granularity. Do NOT summarize or fold them into \"Requirements\".\n   - This section shares the concrete image of \"what constitutes done\".\n   - Recommended format: numbered chronological lists.\n5. **Testing for the Requirements**:\n   - Describe **automated** verification steps for each requirement.\n   - **IMPORTANT (Mandatory Automated Verification)**: Manual-only plans (\"visually confirm the screen\") are NOT allowed. Always specify verification commands using project-standard scripts:\n     - `scripts/process/build.sh`\n     - `scripts/process/integration_test.sh`\n   - Map each requirement to the script/test case that verifies it.\n\n## 4. Create and Save\n\n1. **User dialogue**: Listen carefully, ask clarifying questions. Organize information along the four axes: Background, Requirements, Implementation Approach, and Verification Scenarios.\n   - **WARNING**: If the user provides concrete steps (Scenarios), do NOT silently convert them into abstract \"functional requirements\" and discard the steps. Always preserve them under \"Verification Scenarios\".\n2. **Markdown formatting**: Use headings, lists, tables, code blocks, and optionally Mermaid diagrams.\n3. **Save** the file to the determined directory.\n\n## 5. Completion Check\n\n1. **Review**: Confirm the spec covers Background, Requirements, and Implementation Approach.\n2. **Present file path**: Show the user a link to the created file.\n3. **Suggest next step**: Propose creating an implementation plan if appropriate (but do NOT proceed without explicit user instruction).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:09:43.822Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring automated documentation generation and project status tracking.","zh":"适用于需要自动化文档生成和项目状态跟踪的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動ドキュメント生成とプロジェクトのステータストラッキングを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동 문서 생성 및 프로젝트 상태 추적이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo que requieren generación automática de documentación y seguimiento del estado del proyecto.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Développement nécessitant une génération automatisée de documentation et un suivi de l''état du projet.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine automatisierte Dokumentenerstellung und eine Projektstatusverfolgung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem geração automática de documentação e acompanhamento de status do projeto.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих автоматизированного создания документации и отслеживания статуса проекта.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يتطلبون توليد وثائق تلقائي وتعقب حالة المشروع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create structured specification documents in Markdown format, utilizing shell scripts like show_current_status.sh for dynamic status checks and output location determination, and supports JSON output for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建结构化规范文档的能力，使用Markdown格式，并利用shell脚本（如show_current_status.sh）进行动态状态检查和输出位置确定，并支持JSON输出以实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントが構造化された仕様書を作成する機能を提供し、Markdown形式を使用し、show_current_status.shなどのシェルスクリプトを使用して動的なステータスチェックと出力場所の決定を行い、シームレスな統合のためのJSON出力をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 구조化된 사양 문서를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Markdown 형식을 사용하고, show_current_status.sh와 같은 셸 스크립트를 사용하여 동적인 상태 확인과 출력 위치를 결정하며, 無縫な統合을 위한 JSON 출력을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear documentos de especificación estructurados en formato Markdown, utilizando scripts de shell como show_current_status.sh para comprobaciones de estado dinámicas y determinación de la ubicación de salida, y admite la salida JSON para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des documents de spécification structurés au format Markdown, en utilisant des scripts shell comme show_current_status.sh pour des vérifications d''état dynamiques et la détermination de l''emplacement de sortie, et prend en charge la sortie JSON pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, strukturierte Spezifikationsdokumente im Markdown-Format zu erstellen, indem Shell-Skripte wie show_current_status.sh für dynamische Statusprüfungen und Ausgabestellenbestimmung verwendet werden, und unterstützt JSON-Ausgaben für eine nahtlose Integration.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar documentos de especificação estruturados no formato Markdown, utilizando scripts de shell como show_current_status.sh para verificação de status dinâmico e determinação de localização de saída, e suporta saída JSON para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать структурированные спецификационные документы в формате Markdown, используя shell-скрипты, такие как show_current_status.sh, для динамической проверки статуса и определения местоположения вывода, и поддерживает вывод JSON для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إنشاء وثائق مواصفات منظمة بالتنسيق Markdown، باستخدام سكريبتات Shell مثل show_current_status.sh للتحقق التلقائي من حالة ومكان إخراج، ودعم الإخراج JSON للتكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating specification document generation","Determining output locations based on project phase and branch","Extracting project status information using JSON output"],"zh":["自动化规范文档生成","根据项目阶段和分支确定输出位置","使用JSON输出提取项目状态信息"],"ja":["仕様書の自動生成","プロジェクトの段階とブランチに基づいて出力場所を決定する","JSON出力を使用してプロジェクトのステータス情報を抽出する"],"ko":["사양 문서 자동 생성","프로젝트 단계와 분기에 따라 출력 위치를 결정하는 것","JSON 출력을 사용하여 프로젝트 상태 정보를 추출하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de la generación de documentos de especificación","Determinación de las ubicaciones de salida en función de la fase y la rama del proyecto","Extracción de información de estado del proyecto utilizando la salida JSON"],"fr":["Automatisation de la génération de documents de spécification","Détermination des emplacements de sortie en fonction de la phase et de la branche du projet","Extraction d''informations d''état du projet à l''aide de la sortie JSON"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Spezifikationsdokumenten","Bestimmung der Ausgabestellen basierend auf der Projektphase und dem Branch","Extraktion von Projektstatusinformationen unter Verwendung der JSON-Ausgabe"],"pt":["Automatizar a geração de documentos de especificação","Determinar localizações de saída com base na fase e branch do projeto","Extrair informações de status do projeto usando saída JSON"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание документов спецификации","Определять местоположение вывода на основе фазы и ветки проекта","Извлекать информацию о статусе проекта с помощью вывода JSON"],"ar":["توليد وثائق مواصفات آلي","تحديد مواقع الإخراج بناءً على مرحلة وفرع المشروع","استخراج معلومات حالة المشروع باستخدام الإخراج JSON"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires execution of shell scripts like show_current_status.sh","Dependent on specific directory structure and file naming conventions"],"zh":["需要执行shell脚本，如show_current_status.sh","依赖于特定的目录结构和文件命名约定"],"ja":["show_current_status.shなどのシェルスクリプトを実行する必要がある","特定のディレクトリ構造とファイル命名規則に依存している"],"ko":["show_current_status.sh와 같은 셸 스크립트를 실행해야 함","특정 디렉토리 구조와 파일 이름 규칙에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la ejecución de scripts de shell como show_current_status.sh","Dependiente de una estructura de directorio específica y convenciones de nomenclatura de archivos"],"fr":["Nécessite l''exécution de scripts shell comme show_current_status.sh","Dépendante d''une structure de répertoire spécifique et de conventions de dénomination de fichiers"],"de":["Erfordert die Ausführung von Shell-Skripten wie show_current_status.sh","Abhängig von einer bestimmten Verzeichnisstruktur und Dateibenennungskonventionen"],"pt":["Exige a execução de scripts de shell como show_current_status.sh","Depende de estrutura de diretório específica e convenções de nomenclatura de arquivos"],"ru":["Требует выполнения shell-скриптов, таких как show_current_status.sh","Зависит от конкретной структуры директории и соглашений об именовании файлов"],"ar":["يتطلب تنفيذ سكريبتات Shell مثل show_current_status.sh","يعتمد على هيكل دليل محدد وتوافق تسمية الملفات"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"bae7fb569e8341e0c55e09838b5ee8c7580516264748fc45e7197b8d0fe1bb6c","qualityScore":29}');
