INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('j-roche-dev/personal-planner/daily-checkin', 'daily-checkin', 'j-roche-dev', 'personal-planner', 'community', 'daily-checkin j-roche-dev personal-planner community The daily-checkin skill enables AI agents to perform morning check-ins, reviewing yesterday''s activities and planning today''s tasks. It benefits developers by streamlining their daily workflow. 日常签到技能使用Bash和npm实现自动化，通过date命令获取实际日期和时间，实现个性化问候 デイリー チェックイン スキルは、Bashとnpmを使用して自動化を実現し、dateコマンドで実際の日付と時間を取得し、個性化された挨拶を行います 일일 체크인 스킬은 Bash와 npm을 사용하여 자동화를 구현하며, date 명령을 통해 실제 날짜와 시간을 가져와 개인화된 인사를 제공합니다 daily-checkin es una habilidad que facilita la gestión del tiempo con autenticación y programación. Utiliza Bash para ejecutar comandos y gestionar tokens de expiración daily-checkin est une compétence qui facilite la gestion du temps avec authentification et planification. Elle utilise Bash pour exécuter des commandes et gérer les jetons d''expiration daily-checkin ist eine Fähigkeit, die die Zeitverwaltung mit Authentifizierung und Zeitplanung erleichtert. Sie verwendet Bash, um Befehle auszuführen und Ablaufzeichen zu verwalten O Daily Check-In é uma ferramenta de automação que ajuda a gerenciar o tempo com check-in diário e planejamento Ежедневный Чек-ин - это инструмент автоматизации, помогающий управлять временем с помощью ежедневного чек-ина и планирования от ИИ Агентов 체크-인 يومي هو أداة تautomatioن تساعد في إدارة الوقت مع 체크-ين يومي وتخطيط how to use daily-checkin daily-checkin setup guide daily-checkin vs other AI skills daily-checkin install what is daily-checkin daily-checkin alternative daily-checkin for AI agents daily-checkin tutorial daily-checkin and Bash daily-checkin and npm 日常签到 Bash自动化 npm脚本 date命令 个性化问候 自动化日常任务 AI工具 AIエージェント Runs `date "+%A %B %d %Y %l:%M %p"` via Bash to determine the actual day of week, date, and time Uses npm to re-authenticate via `npm run auth` in case of token expiry errors Supports conversational greetings based on the time of day (good morning/afternoon/evening) Enables planning and review of daily activities through a conversational interface daily-checkin is a conversational AI skill that facilitates morning check-ins with a two-part review and planning process, utilizing Bash and npm for execution.');
