usuário como {{GSD_ARGS}}","Compatibilidade com Codex"],"ru":["Вызов навыков через синтаксис Claude Code","Сопоставление параметров для request_user_input","Поддержка опций, отформатированных как \"Label\" — описание","Обработка текста пользователя как {{GSD_ARGS}}","Совместимость с Codex"],"ar":["استدعاء المهارات عبر لغة Claude Code","تنسيق المعاملات ل request_user_input","دعم الخيارات المصممة ك \"Label\" — وصف","معالجة نص المستخدم ك {{GSD_ARGS}}","التوافق مع Codex"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gsd-quick","gsd-quick setup guide","gsd-quick alternative","gsd-quick vs other AI skills","what is gsd-quick","gsd-quick install","gsd-quick documentation","request_user_input mapping","AskUserQuestion syntax"],"zh":["gsd-quick","AI开发","AI集成","快速开发","参数映射","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input"],"ja":["gsd-quick","AIエージェント","AI開発","AI集成","簡素化","パラメーターマッピング","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input"],"ko":["gsd-quick","AI 개발","AI 통합","빠른 개발","매개변수 매핑","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","인보케이션"],"es":["gsd-quick","herramientas de inteligencia artificial","desarrollo de software","flujos de trabajo de GSD","Claude Code","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","parámetros de cabecera","pregunta de usuario"],"fr":["gsd-quick","outils d''intelligence artificielle","développement de logiciels","flux de travail GSD","Claude Code","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","paramètres d''en-tête","question de l''utilisateur"],"de":["gsd-quick","KI-Tools","Software-Entwicklung","GSD-Workflows","Claude-Code","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","Header-Parameter","Benutzerfrage"],"pt":["gsd-quick","automação de tarefas","ferramenta de desenvolvedor","invocação de habilidades","mapeamento de parâmetros","sintaxe Claude Code","request_user_input","Codex"],"ru":["ИИ Агент gsd-quick","автоматизация задач","инструмент для разработчиков","вызов навыков","сопоставление параметров","синтаксис Claude Code","request_user_input","Codex"],"ar":["أداة gsd-quick","أداة تحكم سريعة في المهام","أداة للمطورين","استدعاء المهارات","تنسيق المعاملات","لغة Claude Code","request_user_input","Codex"]}},"owner":"NUbivek","repo":"Searchbar3","repoPath":"NUbivek/Searchbar3","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:47:18Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd-quick","description":"Execute a quick task with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, state tracking) but skip optional agents","bodyPreview":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Lab","body":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Label\", description: \"description\"}`\n- Generate `id` from header: lowercase, replace spaces with underscores\n\nBatched calls:\n- `AskUserQuestion([q1, q2])` → single `request_user_input` with multiple entries in `questions[]`\n\nMulti-select workaround:\n- Codex has no `multiSelect`. Use sequential single-selects, or present a numbered freeform list asking the user to enter comma-separated numbers.\n\nExecute mode fallback:\n- When `request_user_input` is rejected (Execute mode), present a plain-text numbered list and pick a reasonable default.\n\n## C. Task() → spawn_agent Mapping\nGSD workflows use `Task(...)` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex collaboration tools:\n\nDirect mapping:\n- `Task(subagent_type=\"X\", prompt=\"Y\")` → `spawn_agent(agent_type=\"X\", message=\"Y\")`\n- `Task(model=\"...\")` → omit (Codex uses per-role config, not inline model selection)\n- `fork_context: false` by default — GSD agents load their own context via `<files_to_read>` blocks\n\nParallel fan-out:\n- Spawn multiple agents → collect agent IDs → `wait(ids)` for all to complete\n\nResult parsing:\n- Look for structured markers in agent output: `CHECKPOINT`, `PLAN COMPLETE`, `SUMMARY`, etc.\n- `close_agent(id)` after collecting results from each agent\n</codex_skill_adapter>\n\n<objective>\nExecute small, ad-hoc tasks with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, STATE.md tracking).\n\nQuick mode is the same system with a shorter path:\n- Spawns gsd-planner (quick mode) + gsd-executor(s)\n- Quick tasks live in `.planning/quick/` separate from planned phases\n- Updates STATE.md \"Quick Tasks Completed\" table (NOT ROADMAP.md)\n\n**Default:** Skips research, plan-checker, verifier. Use when you know exactly what to do.\n\n**`--full` flag:** Enables plan-checking (max 2 iterations) and post-execution verification. Use when you want quality guarantees without full milestone ceremony.\n</objective>\n\n<execution_context>\n@./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md\n</execution_context>\n\n<context>\n{{GSD_ARGS}}\n\nContext files are resolved inside the workflow (`init quick`) and delegated via `<files_to_read>` blocks.\n</context>\n\n<process>\nExecute the quick workflow from @./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md end-to-end.\nPreserve all workflow gates (validation, task description, planning, execution, state updates, commits).\n</process>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:15:45.905Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing efficient workflow invocation and user input handling.","zh":"非常适合需要高效工作流调用和用户输入处理的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが効率的なワークフロー呼び出しとユーザー入力処理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"효율적인 워크플로 호출 및 사용자 입력 처리가 필요한 태스크 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan invocación de flujo de trabajo eficiente y manejo de entrada de usuario.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de tâches ayant besoin d''une invocation de flux de travail efficace et d''une gestion des entrées utilisateur.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine effiziente Workflow-Ausführung und Benutzereingabehandhabung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de invocação de fluxo de trabalho eficiente e tratamento de entrada de usuário.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов управления задачами, требующих эффективного вызова рабочего процесса и обработки пользовательского ввода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات إدارة المهام التي تحتاج إلى استدعاء سير عمل فعال ومعالجة إدخال المستخدم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline workflows using $gsd-quick invocation and features like request_user_input for seamless user interaction, leveraging AskUserQuestion syntax from Claude Code and parameter mapping for headers, questions, and options.","zh":"通过 $gsd-quick 调用和 request_user_input 等功能，实现无缝的用户交互，并利用 Claude Code 的 AskUserQuestion 语法和参数映射来处理标题、问题和选项，从而让代理能够简化工作流程。","ja":"$gsd-quick 呼び出しと request_user_input などの機能を使用して、シームレスなユーザーとのやり取りを実現し、Claude Code の AskUserQuestion 構文とパラメーターマッピングを使用してヘッダー、質問、オプションを効率的に処理することで、エージェントがワークフローをストリームライン化できるようにします。","ko":"$gsd-quick 호출 및 request_user_input와 같은 기능을 통해 무결점의 사용자 상호작용을 구현하고, Claude Code의 AskUserQuestion 구문 및 매개변수 매핑을 사용하여 헤더, 질문 및 옵션을 효율적으로 처리함으로써 에이전트가 워크플로우를 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los flujos de trabajo utilizando la invocación rápida $gsd-quick y características como request_user_input para una interacción del usuario sin problemas, aprovechando la sintaxis AskUserQuestion de Claude Code y el mapeo de parámetros para encabezados, preguntas y opciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser les flux de travail en utilisant l''invocation rapide $gsd-quick et des fonctionnalités comme request_user_input pour une interaction utilisateur sans accroc, en exploitant la syntaxe AskUserQuestion de Claude Code et le mappage de paramètres pour les en-têtes, les questions et les options.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Workflows mithilfe der schnellen Invocation $gsd-quick und Funktionen wie request_user_input für eine nahtlose Benutzerinteraktion zu optimieren, wobei die AskUserQuestion-Syntax von Claude Code und die Parameternutzung für Header, Fragen und Optionen genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar os fluxos de trabalho usando a invocação rápida $gsd-quick e recursos como request_user_input para interação do usuário sem interrupções, aproveitando a sintaxe AskUserQuestion do Claude Code e o mapeamento de parâmetros para cabeçalhos, perguntas e opções.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать рабочие процессы с помощью быстрого вызова $gsd-quick и функций, таких как request_user_input для бесшовного взаимодействия с пользователем, используя синтаксис AskUserQuestion из Claude Code и сопоставление параметров для заголовков, вопросов и опций.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تحسين سير العمل باستخدام استدعاء سريع $gsd-quick وميزات مثل request_user_input للتفاعل المستخدم دون انقطاع، مستفيدا من بناء جملة AskUserQuestion من Claude Code وتوكيد 매핑 매개 변수 للرؤوس والأسئلة والخيارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Invoking workflows with $gsd-quick for rapid task management","Utilizing request_user_input for interactive user prompts","Mapping AskUserQuestion parameters for efficient question handling"],"zh":["使用 $gsd-quick 进行快速任务管理的工作流调用","利用 request_user_input 进行交互式用户提示","映射 AskUserQuestion 参数以实现高效的问题处理"],"ja":["$gsd-quick を使用して迅速なタスク管理のワークフロー呼び出しを行う","request_user_input を使用してインタラクティブなユーザープロンプトを行う","AskUserQuestion パラメータをマッピングして効率的な質問処理を行う"],"ko":["$gsd-quick를 사용하여 신속한 태스크 관리 워크플로 호출을 수행하는 것","request_user_input를 사용하여 상호작용형 사용자 프롬프트를 수행하는 것","AskUserQuestion 매개변수를 매핑하여 효율적인 질문 처리를 수행하는 것"],"es":["Invocación de flujos de trabajo con $gsd-quick para una gestión de tareas rápida","Uso de request_user_input para promts de usuario interactivos","Asignación de parámetros AskUserQuestion para un manejo de preguntas eficiente"],"fr":["Invocation de flux de travail avec $gsd-quick pour une gestion de tâches rapide","Utilisation de request_user_input pour des invites de l''utilisateur interactives","Mappage de paramètres AskUserQuestion pour un traitement de questions efficace"],"de":["Ausführung von Workflows mit $gsd-quick für eine schnelle Aufgabenverwaltung","Verwendung von request_user_input für interaktive Benutzereingaben","Zuweisung von AskUserQuestion-Parametern für eine effiziente Fragebehandlung"],"pt":["Invocar fluxos de trabalho com $gsd-quick para gerenciamento de tarefas rápido","Utilizar request_user_input para prompts de usuário interativos","Mapear parâmetros AskUserQuestion para tratamento eficiente de perguntas"],"ru":["Вызов рабочих процессов с помощью $gsd-quick для быстрого управления задачами","Использование request_user_input для интерактивных пользовательских подсказок","Сопоставление параметров AskUserQuestion для эффективного обработки вопросов"],"ar":["استدعاء سير العمل مع $gsd-quick لإدارة المهام السريعة","استخدام request_user_input لنصائح المستخدم التفاعلية","توكيد معلمات AskUserQuestion لمعالجة الأسئلة الفعالة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires $gsd-quick invocation for skill activation","Limited to Codex skill adapter compatibility"],"zh":["需要 $gsd-quick 调用来激活技能","仅限于 Codex 技能适配器的兼容性"],"ja":["$gsd-quick 呼び出しを使用してスキルをアクティブ化する必要がある","Codex スキルアダプターの互換性のみに限定される"],"ko":["$gsd-quick 호출을 사용하여 스킬을 활성화해야 함","Codex 스킬 어댑터의 호환성만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere la invocación $gsd-quick para la activación de la habilidad","Limitado a la compatibilidad del adaptador de habilidades Codex"],"fr":["Nécessite l''invocation $gsd-quick pour l''activation de la compétence","Limité à la compatibilité de l''adaptateur de compétences Codex"],"de":["Benötigt die $gsd-quick-Invocation für die Aktivierung der Fähigkeit","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität des Codex-Fähigkeitsadapters"],"pt":["Exige invocação $gsd-quick para ativação de habilidade","Limitado à compatibilidade do adaptador de habilidade Codex"],"ru":["Требует вызова $gsd-quick для активации навыка","Ограничен совместимостью адаптера навыка Codex"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء $gsd-quick لتنشيط المهارة","محدود بالتوافق مع محول مهارة Codex"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f50d7ba23acd3150f7ec741696c961dd8312137477de1bfebd9f7b5f0e9f4bda","qualityScore":29}');
