"],"pt":["Invocação de habilidades via `$gsd-quick`","Tratamento de argumentos como `{{GSD_ARGS}}`","Mapeamento de parâmetros para `request_user_input`","Suporte a opções formatadas como `\"Label\" — description`"],"ru":["Вызов способностей через `$gsd-quick`","Обработка аргументов как `{{GSD_ARGS}}`","Отображение параметров на `request_user_input`","Поддержка опций, отформатированных как `\"Label\" — description`"],"ar":["استدعاء المهارات عبر `$gsd-quick`","معالجة الحجج كـ `{{GSD_ARGS}}`","تعيين المعلمات إلى `request_user_input`","دعم الخيارات المنسقة كـ `\"Label\" — description`"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gsd-quick","gsd-quick setup guide","gsd-quick alternative","gsd-quick vs Claude Code","invoking gsd-quick workflows","gsd-quick install","what is gsd-quick","gsd-quick documentation","gsd-quick AI agent integration"],"zh":["gsd-quick技能","AI智能工具","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","用户交互","输入处理","AIエージェント","效率的な統合"],"ja":["gsd-quickスキル","AIエージェント","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","ユーザーインタラクション","入力処理","効率的な統合","AIツール"],"ko":["gsd-quick스킬","AI 에이전트","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","사용자 상호 작용","입력 처리","효율적인 통합","AI 도구"],"es":["gsd-quick","AI para desarrolladores","Herramientas de AI","Codex","Invocación de funciones","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","Desarrollo de software","Tecnologías de AI"],"fr":["gsd-quick","IA pour les développeurs","Outils d''IA","Codex","Invocation de fonctions","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","Développement de logiciels","Technologies d''IA"],"de":["gsd-quick","KI für Entwickler","KI-Tools","Codex","Funktionsaufruf","request_user_input","AskUserQuestion","Software-Entwicklung","KI-Technologien"],"pt":["gsd-quick","habilidade de IA","fluxos de trabalho de IA","desenvolvimento de soluções de IA","configuração de habilidades de IA","invocação de habilidades de IA"],"ru":["gsd-quick","способность ИИ","рабочие процессы ИИ","разработка решений ИИ","настройка способностей ИИ","вызов способностей ИИ","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["gsd-quick","مهارة ذكية","سير عمل ذكية","تطوير حلول ذكية","تكوين مهارات ذكية","استدعاء مهارات ذكية","أدوات ذكية"]}},"owner":"rapchai-k","repo":"the-third-place","repoPath":"rapchai-k/the-third-place","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:30:46Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd-quick","description":"Execute a quick task with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, state tracking) but skip optional agents","bodyPreview":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Lab","body":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Label\", description: \"description\"}`\n- Generate `id` from header: lowercase, replace spaces with underscores\n\nBatched calls:\n- `AskUserQuestion([q1, q2])` → single `request_user_input` with multiple entries in `questions[]`\n\nMulti-select workaround:\n- Codex has no `multiSelect`. Use sequential single-selects, or present a numbered freeform list asking the user to enter comma-separated numbers.\n\nExecute mode fallback:\n- When `request_user_input` is rejected (Execute mode), present a plain-text numbered list and pick a reasonable default.\n\n## C. Task() → spawn_agent Mapping\nGSD workflows use `Task(...)` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex collaboration tools:\n\nDirect mapping:\n- `Task(subagent_type=\"X\", prompt=\"Y\")` → `spawn_agent(agent_type=\"X\", message=\"Y\")`\n- `Task(model=\"...\")` → omit (Codex uses per-role config, not inline model selection)\n- `fork_context: false` by default — GSD agents load their own context via `<files_to_read>` blocks\n\nParallel fan-out:\n- Spawn multiple agents → collect agent IDs → `wait(ids)` for all to complete\n\nResult parsing:\n- Look for structured markers in agent output: `CHECKPOINT`, `PLAN COMPLETE`, `SUMMARY`, etc.\n- `close_agent(id)` after collecting results from each agent\n</codex_skill_adapter>\n\n<objective>\nExecute small, ad-hoc tasks with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, STATE.md tracking).\n\nQuick mode is the same system with a shorter path:\n- Spawns gsd-planner (quick mode) + gsd-executor(s)\n- Quick tasks live in `.planning/quick/` separate from planned phases\n- Updates STATE.md \"Quick Tasks Completed\" table (NOT ROADMAP.md)\n\n**Default:** Skips research, plan-checker, verifier. Use when you know exactly what to do.\n\n**`--full` flag:** Enables plan-checking (max 2 iterations) and post-execution verification. Use when you want quality guarantees without full milestone ceremony.\n</objective>\n\n<execution_context>\n@./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md\n</execution_context>\n\n<context>\n{{GSD_ARGS}}\n\nContext files are resolved inside the workflow (`init quick`) and delegated via `<files_to_read>` blocks.\n</context>\n\n<process>\nExecute the quick workflow from @./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md end-to-end.\nPreserve all workflow gates (validation, task description, planning, execution, state updates, commits).\n</process>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T04:17:12.860Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing streamlined workflow invocation and Claude Code syntax support.","zh":"非常适合需要简化工作流调用和支持 Claude Code 语法的开发者代理。","ja":"開発者エージェントがストリームライン化されたワークフローの呼び出しと Claude Code 構文のサポートを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"워크플로우 호출과 Claude Code 구문을 지원하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan una invocación de flujo de trabajo simplificada y soporte de sintaxis de Claude Code.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développeur nécessitant une invocation de workflow simplifiée et un support de syntaxe de Claude Code.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die eine vereinfachte Workflow-Aufruf und Claude Code Syntax-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de invocação de fluxo de trabalho otimizada e suporte à sintaxe Claude Code.","ru":"Идеально для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходима оптимизированная вызов рабочих процессов и поддержка синтаксиса Claude Code.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى استدعاء سير عمل مبسط ودعم بناء جملة Claude Code."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to invoke workflows using $gsd-quick, seamlessly mapping AskUserQuestion to request_user_input and leveraging Codex syntax for efficient user input handling, utilizing parameters like header and question.","zh":"赋予代理调用工作流使用 $gsd-quick 的能力，实现 AskUserQuestion 到 request_user_input 的无缝映射，并利用 Codex 语法高效处理用户输入，使用诸如 header 和 question 的参数。","ja":"$gsd-quick を使用してワークフローを呼び出す機能をエージェントに与え、AskUserQuestion を request_user_input にシームレスにマッピングし、効率的なユーザー入力処理のための Codex 構文を利用し、header や question などのパラメーターを使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 $gsd-quick를 사용하여 워크플로우를 호출하는 기능을 제공하고, AskUserQuestion를 request_user_input로無縫に 매핑하며, 효율적인 사용자 입력 처리를 위한 Codex 구문을 활용하고, header 및 question과 같은 매개변수를 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a invocar flujos de trabajo usando $gsd-quick, asignando sin problemas AskUserQuestion a request_user_input y aprovechando la sintaxis de Codex para un manejo eficiente de la entrada del usuario, utilizando parámetros como header y question.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''invoker des workflows en utilisant $gsd-quick, en mappant sans effort AskUserQuestion à request_user_input et en exploitant la syntaxe de Codex pour un traitement efficace de la saisie utilisateur, en utilisant des paramètres tels que header et question.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Workflows mit $gsd-quick aufzurufen, indem AskUserQuestion ohne Probleme auf request_user_input abgebildet und die Codex-Syntax für eine effiziente Benutzereingabe-Verarbeitung genutzt wird, unter Verwendung von Parametern wie Header und Frage.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a invocar fluxos de trabalho usando $gsd-quick, mapeando AskUserQuestion para request_user_input de forma transparente e utilizando a sintaxe Codex para tratamento eficiente de entrada de usuário, utilizando parâmetros como header e question.","ru":"Позволяет агентам вызывать рабочие процессы с помощью $gsd-quick, прозрачно сопоставляя AskUserQuestion с request_user_input и используя синтаксис Codex для эффективного xử lý пользовательского ввода, используя параметры như header и question.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من استدعاء سير العمل باستخدام $gsd-quick، و映射 AskUserQuestion إلى request_user_input بصوره متواصلة واخذ بنظر الاعتبار بناء جملة Codex للتعامل الفعال مع المدخلات المستخدم، باستخدام معاملات مثل header و question."},"useCases":{"en":["Invoking GSD workflows with dynamic user input","Translating AskUserQuestion to request_user_input for Codex compatibility","Streamlining developer workflows with $gsd-quick syntax"],"zh":["使用动态用户输入调用 GSD 工作流","将 AskUserQuestion 翻译为 request_user_input 以实现 Codex 兼容性","使用 $gsd-quick 语法简化开发者工作流"],"ja":["動的なユーザー入力を使用して GSD ワークフローを呼び出す","AskUserQuestion を request_user_input に翻訳して Codex との互換性を実現する","$gsd-quick 構文を使用して開発者ワークフローをストリームライン化する"],"ko":["동적 사용자 입력을 사용하여 GSD 워크플로우 호출","AskUserQuestion를 request_user_input로 번역하여 Codex 호환성 구현","$gsd-quick 구문을 사용하여 개발자 워크플로우를 간소화"],"es":["Invocar flujos de trabajo de GSD con entrada de usuario dinámica","Traducir AskUserQuestion a request_user_input para la compatibilidad con Codex","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de desarrollador con la sintaxis de $gsd-quick"],"fr":["Invocer des workflows GSD avec une saisie utilisateur dynamique","Traduire AskUserQuestion en request_user_input pour la compatibilité avec Codex","Optimiser les flux de travail de développeur avec la syntaxe de $gsd-quick"],"de":["Aufrufen von GSD-Workflows mit dynamischer Benutzereingabe","Übersetzen von AskUserQuestion in request_user_input für Codex-Kompatibilität","Optimieren von Entwickler-Workflows mit der Syntax von $gsd-quick"],"pt":["Invocar fluxos de trabalho GSD com entrada de usuário dinâmica","Traduzir AskUserQuestion para request_user_input para compatibilidade com Codex","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de desenvolvedor com sintaxe $gsd-quick"],"ru":["Вызов рабочих процессов GSD с динамическим пользовательским вводом","Перевод AskUserQuestion в request_user_input для совместимости с Codex","Оптимизация рабочих процессов разработчика с синтаксисом $gsd-quick"],"ar":["استدعاء سير عمل GSD مع مدخلات مستخدم ديناميكية","ترجمة AskUserQuestion إلى request_user_input للتوافق مع Codex","تحسين سير عمل المطور باستخدام بناء الجملة $gsd-quick"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code syntax knowledge","Limited to workflows invoking $gsd-quick"],"zh":["需要 Claude Code 语法知识","仅限调用 $gsd-quick 的工作流"],"ja":["Claude Code 構文の知識が必要","$gsd-quick を呼び出すワークフローに限定される"],"ko":["Claude Code 구문 지식 필요","$gsd-quick를 호출하는 워크플로우로 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la sintaxis de Claude Code","Limitado a flujos de trabajo que invocan $gsd-quick"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en syntaxe de Claude Code","Limité aux workflows qui invoquent $gsd-quick"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse in der Syntax von Claude Code","Begrenzt auf Workflows, die $gsd-quick aufrufen"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da sintaxe Claude Code","Limitado a fluxos de trabalho que invocam $gsd-quick"],"ru":["Требует знания синтаксиса Claude Code","Ограничен рабочими процессами, вызывающими $gsd-quick"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بناء جملة Claude Code","محدود بسير العمل التي تستدعي $gsd-quick"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f50d7ba23acd3150f7ec741696c961dd8312137477de1bfebd9f7b5f0e9f4bda","qualityScore":29}');
