Codex для request_user_input"],"ar":["استدعاء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي بالحجج المخصصة","تعيين المعلمات لسير عمل GSD","معالجة الحجج الفارغة","دعم لغة Claude Code","التكامل مع Codex ل request_user_input"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use gsd-quick","gsd-quick alternative","gsd-quick setup guide","what is gsd-quick","gsd-quick vs other AI agent skills","gsd-quick install","gsd-quick workflow automation","gsd-quick command invocation","gsd-quick parameter mapping"],"zh":["gsd-quick","AI开发工具","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","开发语言","集成和开发","效率开发","开发工具"],"ja":["gsd-quick","AIエージェント","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","開発言語","集成と開発","効率開発","開発ツール"],"ko":["gsd-quick","AI 개발 도구","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","개발 언어","통합과 개발","효율 개발","개발 도구"],"es":["gsd-quick","habilidades de AI","procesamiento de texto","Codex","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","Claude Code","sintaxis de traducción","desarrollo de AI"],"fr":["gsd-quick","compétences IA","traitement de texte","Codex","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","Claude Code","syntaxe de traduction","développement d''IA"],"de":["gsd-quick","KI-Fähigkeiten","Textverarbeitung","Codex","AskUserQuestion","request_user_input","Claude Code","Übersetzungssyntax","KI-Entwicklung"],"pt":["gsd-quick","habilidades AI","invocação de funções","mapeamento de parâmetros","workflows de GSD","Codex","request_user_input","syntaxe Claude Code"],"ru":["gsd-quick","ИИ Агенты","вызов функций","сопоставление параметров","рабочие процессы GSD","Codex","request_user_input","синтаксис Claude Code"],"ar":["gsd-quick","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","استدعاء الوظائف","تعيين المعلمات","سير عمل GSD","Codex","request_user_input","لغة Claude Code"]}},"owner":"fnuAshutosh","repo":"Medimind","repoPath":"fnuAshutosh/Medimind","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T07:21:33Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"gsd-quick","description":"Execute a quick task with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, state tracking) but skip optional agents","bodyPreview":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Lab","body":"<codex_skill_adapter>\n## A. Skill Invocation\n- This skill is invoked by mentioning `$gsd-quick`.\n- Treat all user text after `$gsd-quick` as `{{GSD_ARGS}}`.\n- If no arguments are present, treat `{{GSD_ARGS}}` as empty.\n\n## B. AskUserQuestion → request_user_input Mapping\nGSD workflows use `AskUserQuestion` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex `request_user_input`:\n\nParameter mapping:\n- `header` → `header`\n- `question` → `question`\n- Options formatted as `\"Label\" — description` → `{label: \"Label\", description: \"description\"}`\n- Generate `id` from header: lowercase, replace spaces with underscores\n\nBatched calls:\n- `AskUserQuestion([q1, q2])` → single `request_user_input` with multiple entries in `questions[]`\n\nMulti-select workaround:\n- Codex has no `multiSelect`. Use sequential single-selects, or present a numbered freeform list asking the user to enter comma-separated numbers.\n\nExecute mode fallback:\n- When `request_user_input` is rejected (Execute mode), present a plain-text numbered list and pick a reasonable default.\n\n## C. Task() → spawn_agent Mapping\nGSD workflows use `Task(...)` (Claude Code syntax). Translate to Codex collaboration tools:\n\nDirect mapping:\n- `Task(subagent_type=\"X\", prompt=\"Y\")` → `spawn_agent(agent_type=\"X\", message=\"Y\")`\n- `Task(model=\"...\")` → omit (Codex uses per-role config, not inline model selection)\n- `fork_context: false` by default — GSD agents load their own context via `<files_to_read>` blocks\n\nParallel fan-out:\n- Spawn multiple agents → collect agent IDs → `wait(ids)` for all to complete\n\nResult parsing:\n- Look for structured markers in agent output: `CHECKPOINT`, `PLAN COMPLETE`, `SUMMARY`, etc.\n- `close_agent(id)` after collecting results from each agent\n</codex_skill_adapter>\n\n<objective>\nExecute small, ad-hoc tasks with GSD guarantees (atomic commits, STATE.md tracking).\n\nQuick mode is the same system with a shorter path:\n- Spawns gsd-planner (quick mode) + gsd-executor(s)\n- Quick tasks live in `.planning/quick/` separate from planned phases\n- Updates STATE.md \"Quick Tasks Completed\" table (NOT ROADMAP.md)\n\n**Default:** Skips research, plan-checker, verifier. Use when you know exactly what to do.\n\n**`--full` flag:** Enables plan-checking (max 2 iterations) and post-execution verification. Use when you want quality guarantees without full milestone ceremony.\n</objective>\n\n<execution_context>\n@./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md\n</execution_context>\n\n<context>\n{{GSD_ARGS}}\n\nContext files are resolved inside the workflow (`init quick`) and delegated via `<files_to_read>` blocks.\n</context>\n\n<process>\nExecute the quick workflow from @./.codex/get-shit-done/workflows/quick.md end-to-end.\nPreserve all workflow gates (validation, task description, planning, execution, state updates, commits).\n</process>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-07T13:11:11.602Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Workflow Automation Agents needing streamlined interactions with AI agents via $gsd-quick commands.","zh":"适用于需要通过 $gsd-quick 命令与 AI 代理进行简化交互的工作流自动化代理。","ja":"AI エージェントとの簡略化されたやりとりが必要なワークフロー オートメーション エージェントに最適です。$gsd-quick コマンドを使用します。","ko":"AI 에이전트와의简化된 상호 작용이 필요한 워크플로 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다. $gsd-quick 명령을 사용합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización de flujos de trabajo que necesitan interacciones optimizadas con agentes de inteligencia artificial a través de comandos $gsd-quick.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation de flux de travail nécessitant des interactions optimisées avec les agents d''intelligence artificielle via des commandes $gsd-quick.","de":"Ideal für Workflow-Automatisierungs-Agents, die optimierte Interaktionen mit KI-Agents über $gsd-quick-Befehle benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Fluxo de Trabalho que necessitam de interações simplificadas com agentes de IA via comandos $gsd-quick.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации рабочих процессов, которым требуются упрощенные взаимодействия с агентами ИИ через команды $gsd-quick.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات التutomatization في Agents التي تحتاج إلى تفاعلات مبسطة مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي عبر أوامر $gsd-quick."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to invoke commands and translate AskUserQuestion to request_user_input, utilizing parameter mappings for seamless integration with Codex and Claude Code syntax, supporting headers, questions, and options formatting.","zh":"赋予代理人调用命令和将 AskUserQuestion 翻译为 request_user_input 的能力，利用参数映射实现与 Codex 和 Claude Code 语法的无缝集成，支持标题、问题和选项的格式化。","ja":"エージェントがコマンドを呼び出し、AskUserQuestion を request_user_input に翻訳する機能を提供し、パラメーターマッピングを使用して Codex および Claude Code 構文とシームレスに統合します。ヘッダー、質問、およびオプションの書式設定をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 명령을 호출하고 AskUserQuestion을 request_user_input으로 변환하여 Codex 및 Claude Code 구문과 매끄럽게 통합할 수 있도록하며, 매개 변수 매핑을 사용하여 헤더, 질문 및 옵션 형식을 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes invocar comandos y traducir AskUserQuestion a request_user_input, utilizando asignaciones de parámetros para una integración perfecta con la sintaxis de Codex y Claude Code, compatible con encabezados, preguntas y formato de opciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''invoker des commandes et de traduire AskUserQuestion en request_user_input, en utilisant des mappages de paramètres pour une intégration transparente avec la syntaxe de Codex et Claude Code, compatible avec les en-têtes, les questions et le formatage des options.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Befehle aufzurufen und AskUserQuestion in request_user_input zu übersetzen, indem Parameterzuordnungen für eine nahtlose Integration mit der Codex- und Claude-Code-Syntax verwendet werden, die Headers, Fragen und Optionen-Formatierung unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a invocar comandos e traduzir AskUserQuestion para request_user_input, utilizando mapeamentos de parâmetros para integração sem problemas com a sintaxe Codex e Claude Code, suportando formatação de cabeçalhos, perguntas e opções.","ru":"Позволяет агентам вызывать команды и переводить AskUserQuestion в request_user_input, используя сопоставления параметров для беспрепятственной интеграции с синтаксисом Codex и Claude Code, поддерживающей форматирование заголовков, вопросов и вариантов.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من استدعاء الأوامر وترجمة AskUserQuestion إلى request_user_input، باستخدام مапات المعلمات لتكامل بدون مشاكل مع بناء الجملة Codex و Claude Code، مع دعم تنسيق العناوين والأسئلة والخيارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating workflows by invoking $gsd-quick commands","Translating AskUserQuestion to request_user_input for Codex compatibility","Streamlining interactions with AI agents using $gsd-quick"],"zh":["通过调用 $gsd-quick 命令自动化工作流","将 AskUserQuestion 翻译为 request_user_input 以实现与 Codex 的兼容性","使用 $gsd-quick 简化与 AI 代理的交互"],"ja":["$gsd-quick コマンドを呼び出してワークフローを自動化する","AskUserQuestion を request_user_input に翻訳して Codex との互換性を実現する","$gsd-quick を使用して AI エージェントとのやりとりを簡略化する"],"ko":["$gsd-quick 명령을 호출하여 워크플로를 자동화하는 것","AskUserQuestion을 request_user_input으로 변환하여 Codex와의 호환성을 제공하는 것","$gsd-quick를 사용하여 AI 에이전트와의 상호 작용을 간소화하는 것"],"es":["Automatizar flujos de trabajo invocando comandos $gsd-quick","Traducir AskUserQuestion a request_user_input para la compatibilidad con Codex","Optimizar interacciones con agentes de inteligencia artificial utilizando $gsd-quick"],"fr":["Automatiser les flux de travail en invocant des commandes $gsd-quick","Traduire AskUserQuestion en request_user_input pour la compatibilité avec Codex","Optimiser les interactions avec les agents d''intelligence artificielle en utilisant $gsd-quick"],"de":["Workflows automatisieren, indem $gsd-quick-Befehle aufgerufen werden","AskUserQuestion in request_user_input für Codex-Kompatibilität übersetzen","Interaktionen mit KI-Agents über $gsd-quick optimieren"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho, invocando comandos $gsd-quick","Traduzir AskUserQuestion para request_user_input para compatibilidade com Codex","Simplificar interações com agentes de IA usando comandos $gsd-quick"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы, вызывая команды $gsd-quick","Переводить AskUserQuestion в request_user_input для совместимости с Codex","Упрощать взаимодействия с агентами ИИ, используя команды $gsd-quick"],"ar":["توفير عمليات تautomatization في العمل عن طريق استدعاء أوامر $gsd-quick","ترجمة AskUserQuestion إلى request_user_input للتوافق مع Codex","تبسيط التفاعلات مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام أوامر $gsd-quick"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires $gsd-quick command invocation","Limited to Codex and Claude Code syntax compatibility"],"zh":["需要调用 $gsd-quick 命令","仅限与 Codex 和 Claude Code 语法兼容"],"ja":["$gsd-quick コマンドの呼び出しが必要","Codex および Claude Code 構文との互換性のみ"],"ko":["$gsd-quick 명령 호출이 필요합니다.","Codex 및 Claude Code 구문과의 호환성만 지원"],"es":["Requiere la invocación de comandos $gsd-quick","Limitado a la compatibilidad con la sintaxis de Codex y Claude Code"],"fr":["Nécessite l''invocation de commandes $gsd-quick","Limité à la compatibilité avec la syntaxe de Codex et Claude Code"],"de":["Benötigt die Aufrufung von $gsd-quick-Befehlen","Begrenzt auf die Kompatibilität mit der Codex- und Claude-Code-Syntax"],"pt":["Requer invocação de comandos $gsd-quick","Limitado à compatibilidade com a sintaxe Codex e Claude Code"],"ru":["Требует вызова команд $gsd-quick","Ограничен совместимостью с синтаксисом Codex и Claude Code"],"ar":["يتطلب استدعاء أوامر $gsd-quick","محدود بالتوافق مع بناء الجملة Codex و Claude Code"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f50d7ba23acd3150f7ec741696c961dd8312137477de1bfebd9f7b5f0e9f4bda","qualityScore":29}');
