INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('KrystianYCSilva/hefesto-skill-generator/coding-agent-tools', 'coding-agent-tools', 'KrystianYCSilva', 'hefesto-skill-generator', 'community', 'coding-agent-tools KrystianYCSilva hefesto-skill-generator community The coding-agent-tools skill guides the setup and usage of the modern AI Pair Programmer stack, helping developers choose the right tools based on interaction depth. Coding Agent Tools是一个生成标准化AI Agent Skills的工具，支持多个CLI的IA，遵循agentskills.io标准 Coding Agent Toolsは、agentskills.io標準に基づいた多くのCLIのIAをサポートする標準化されたAI Agent Skillsを生成するツールです Coding Agent Tools는 여러 CLI의 IA를 지원하는 표준화된 AI 에이전트 스킬을 생성하는 도구입니다 Hefesto es un generador de habilidades que crea habilidades de agentes estandarizadas para múltiples interfaces de línea de comandos de IA, siguiendo el estándar abierto agentskills.io Hefesto est un générateur de compétences qui crée des compétences d''agents standardisées pour plusieurs interfaces de ligne de commande d''IA, suivant la norme ouverte agentskills.io Hefesto ist ein Skill-Generator, der standardisierte Agent-Skills für mehrere KI-Command-Line-Interfaces erstellt, basierend auf dem offenen Standard agentskills.io O Hefesto é um gerador de skills que cria Agent Skills padronizadas para múltiplos CLIs de IA. Aprenda a configurá-lo para codificação de agentes Hefesto - это генератор навыков, создающий стандартизированные навыки агентов для нескольких CLI ИИ. Узнайте, как его настроить Hefesto هو مولد مهارات يخلق مهارات وكلاء معيارية لأوامر متعددة من الإصطناع. تعلم كيفية إعداده how to use coding-agent-tools coding-agent-tools setup guide what is coding-agent-tools coding-agent-tools alternative coding-agent-tools vs GitHub Copilot coding-agent-tools install AI Pair Programmer stack agentskills.io standard CLI Agent tools AI编程助手 AI Agent Skills agentskills.io CLI工具 Coding Agent Tools AI开发工具 自动化编程 Supports CLI Agents like Claude Code and Aider for full-file refactoring and multi-file edits Provides a comparison guide for selecting the right AI coding tools based on interaction depth Includes tools like GitHub Copilot for IDE-based autocomplete and boilerplate generation Follows the open standard agentskills.io for standardized Agent Skills Enables ''Apply this feature'' functionality for efficient coding workflows Offers a detailed CLI Guide for reference coding-agent-tools is a generator of skills that creates standardized Agent Skills for multiple CLIs of IA, following the open standard agentskills.io');
